(3808429, 538586, 70514, '<td valign="top">What an interesting image!  I''m trying to figure out the purpose of having a mirror "sign" like this.  Nice find.  I think the only way I would''ve tried to improve it (since it''s not moving?) is to have had it a bit farther to the right of the image and maybe clean the mirror.  But still very nice!</td>', 'What an interesting image!  I''m trying to figure out the purpose of having a mirror "sign" like this.  Nice find.  I think the only way I would''ve tried to improve it (since it''s not moving?) is to have had it a bit farther to the right of the image and maybe clean the mirror.  But still very nice!', '2007-06-20 13:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3808438, 539863, 34192, '<td valign="top">what makes this better, for me, from the other ''sunset'' shots in this challenge are: the use of alternating light and dark, and the shadow of the chair.  This works really well together. 8</td>', 'what makes this better, for me, from the other ''sunset'' shots in this challenge are: the use of alternating light and dark, and the shadow of the chair.  This works really well together. 8', '2007-06-20 13:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
