(3808647, 538414, 59198, '<td valign="top">This is an EXCELLENT idea!!! I give you props on this one. However, this is just my opinion, it needs a little work. I think that the lighting is a little off. It is definitely WAY too soft. <br/> <br/>I was thinking that a spot light on this would be awesome. The edges real dark and then fading into light right where the missing piece is. AND tack sharp is a must!!!! If you do not mind, I would love to try this...just email me to let me know if I CAN...I will give you created for the idea...<br/>good luck</td>', 'This is an EXCELLENT idea!!! I give you props on this one. However, this is just my opinion, it needs a little work. I think that the lighting is a little off. It is definitely WAY too soft.  I was thinking that a spot light on this would be awesome. The edges real dark and then fading into light right where the missing piece is. AND tack sharp is a must!!!! If you do not mind, I would love to try this...just email me to let me know if I CAN...I will give you created for the idea...good luck', '2007-06-20 14:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
