(3810247, 536914, 77192, '<td valign="top">meets the challenge very well. However it does look a bit white in general for me. In particular, the sky looks a bit washed out. Have you considered dropping the exposure down a stop or using a polarising filter?</td>', 'meets the challenge very well. However it does look a bit white in general for me. In particular, the sky looks a bit washed out. Have you considered dropping the exposure down a stop or using a polarising filter?', '2007-06-20 18:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
