(3817249, 538454, 36382, '<td valign="top">This is classic.. I love how the white of his shirt forms a v emphasising his face.  The lighting is gorgeous, and his face is so interesting.  Best of the challenge.</td>', 'This is classic.. I love how the white of his shirt forms a v emphasising his face.  The lighting is gorgeous, and his face is so interesting.  Best of the challenge.', '2007-06-21 19:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
