(3817508, 539517, 50695, '<td valign="top">a diminished, fading subject is hindered from creating interesting negative space. A good negative requires a good positive.</td>', 'a diminished, fading subject is hindered from creating interesting negative space. A good negative requires a good positive.', '2007-06-21 20:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817521, 540111, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like this photo. The molded and darkened bricks along the bottom create a strange jagged little border for the negative space. Just barely, though!</td>', 'I like this photo. The molded and darkened bricks along the bottom create a strange jagged little border for the negative space. Just barely, though!', '2007-06-21 20:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817525, 539411, 50695, '<td valign="top">this is a case where the dark clouds are sufficiently prominent and the equal to the land to create a real sense of negative space between them. Well done.</td>', 'this is a case where the dark clouds are sufficiently prominent and the equal to the land to create a real sense of negative space between them. Well done.', '2007-06-21 20:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817534, 539803, 50695, '<td valign="top">It''s good that your lily goes off the edge, but not good that there''s so much space on the right. It would better use negative space to se it on both sides of the lily.</td>', 'It''s good that your lily goes off the edge, but not good that there''s so much space on the right. It would better use negative space to se it on both sides of the lily.', '2007-06-21 20:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817541, 539754, 50695, '<td valign="top">the best thing going for this is the bulge of the neck. other than that it''s a typical flying bird shape too small to create interesting negative space.</td>', 'the best thing going for this is the bulge of the neck. other than that it''s a typical flying bird shape too small to create interesting negative space.', '2007-06-21 20:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817550, 539766, 50695, '<td valign="top">the clash of blues and greens here make me wonder which is the negative space? I like wondering. 6</td>', 'the clash of blues and greens here make me wonder which is the negative space? I like wondering. 6', '2007-06-21 20:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817556, 539552, 50695, '<td valign="top">obscenity created with negative space! This is my favorite so far. 10</td>', 'obscenity created with negative space! This is my favorite so far. 10', '2007-06-21 20:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817568, 540057, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is a cool photo with little people at various distances. I wonder though if such little subjects are capable of creating negative space. You see, it''s the positive space that creates negative space.</td>', 'This is a cool photo with little people at various distances. I wonder though if such little subjects are capable of creating negative space. You see, it''s the positive space that creates negative space.', '2007-06-21 20:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817575, 540086, 50695, '<td valign="top">Negative space must be shaped by positive space in order to have impact.</td>', 'Negative space must be shaped by positive space in order to have impact.', '2007-06-21 20:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817580, 539899, 50695, '<td valign="top">Good example of negative space. The shapes of visible subject in turn create shapes of negative space. I don''t like the composition, though, pushing her to one side like that. I see it often at dpc, and it is meaningless, or conveys a misunderstanding of negative space.</td>', 'Good example of negative space. The shapes of visible subject in turn create shapes of negative space. I don''t like the composition, though, pushing her to one side like that. I see it often at dpc, and it is meaningless, or conveys a misunderstanding of negative space.', '2007-06-21 20:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817583, 537989, 50695, '<td valign="top">negative space within negative space. Good.</td>', 'negative space within negative space. Good.', '2007-06-21 20:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817587, 538650, 50695, '<td valign="top">Yes, good, dark reflections + silhouette carve out negative space.</td>', 'Yes, good, dark reflections + silhouette carve out negative space.', '2007-06-21 20:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817595, 539208, 50695, '<td valign="top">Even though this has no interesting negative space, it does poke fun at the challenge description, so I give you points for that! :)</td>', 'Even though this has no interesting negative space, it does poke fun at the challenge description, so I give you points for that! :)', '2007-06-21 20:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817601, 538570, 50695, '<td valign="top">Yes! the highlights create positive shapes that in turn create negative space. However, you should crop closer or surround with other objects so that you create negative shapes as well as positive shapes. That''s the point of negative space that even Langdon doesn''t seem to understand.</td>', 'Yes! the highlights create positive shapes that in turn create negative space. However, you should crop closer or surround with other objects so that you create negative shapes as well as positive shapes. That''s the point of negative space that even Langdon doesn''t seem to understand.', '2007-06-21 20:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817606, 538443, 50695, '<td valign="top">The visible foldings of the sheets confuse the negative space. One gets a sense of overall texture rather than positive v. negative space. This isn''t a bad thing, but it doesn''t meet the challenge.</td>', 'The visible foldings of the sheets confuse the negative space. One gets a sense of overall texture rather than positive v. negative space. This isn''t a bad thing, but it doesn''t meet the challenge.', '2007-06-21 20:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817609, 539297, 50695, '<td valign="top">well, there''s some hints of negative space in the way things cut into the sky, but having so much sky up top obliterates this sense.</td>', 'well, there''s some hints of negative space in the way things cut into the sky, but having so much sky up top obliterates this sense.', '2007-06-21 20:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817612, 536290, 50695, '<td valign="top">a crisp chair shadow and a closer crop would have created a sense of negative space here.</td>', 'a crisp chair shadow and a closer crop would have created a sense of negative space here.', '2007-06-21 21:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817614, 538277, 50695, '<td valign="top">Yes, good, there is a dramatic shape of negative space here.</td>', 'Yes, good, there is a dramatic shape of negative space here.', '2007-06-21 21:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817619, 537119, 50695, '<td valign="top">not a very interesting shape of negative space here.</td>', 'not a very interesting shape of negative space here.', '2007-06-21 21:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817624, 540002, 50695, '<td valign="top">Nice texture in your negative space, but not an interesting shape.</td>', 'Nice texture in your negative space, but not an interesting shape.', '2007-06-21 21:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817628, 539602, 50695, '<td valign="top">a large field of blankness does not have enought positive space to create negative space.</td>', 'a large field of blankness does not have enought positive space to create negative space.', '2007-06-21 21:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817631, 538834, 50695, '<td valign="top">a closer crop would bring out the negative space better.</td>', 'a closer crop would bring out the negative space better.', '2007-06-21 21:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817636, 538693, 7786, '<td valign="top">Where is all that snow this late in the season! I feel like packing my snowboarding and start driving towards it. <br/> <br/>The picture is fine but having the horizont a little higher (rule of thirds) would make it better.</td>', 'Where is all that snow this late in the season! I feel like packing my snowboarding and start driving towards it.  The picture is fine but having the horizont a little higher (rule of thirds) would make it better.', '2007-06-21 21:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817639, 540134, 50695, '<td valign="top">To create interesting negative space, darken the dog a little so that it fades into the background a little more, then crop closer to the dog. Voila! Negative space!</td>', 'To create interesting negative space, darken the dog a little so that it fades into the background a little more, then crop closer to the dog. Voila! Negative space!', '2007-06-21 21:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817640, 539294, 50695, '<td valign="top">some negative space on the bottom, but none up top.</td>', 'some negative space on the bottom, but none up top.', '2007-06-21 21:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817645, 537245, 50695, '<td valign="top">wonderful example of negative space, but crop closer to bring it out. Hint: your negative space is on the right side of the frame, not the left!</td>', 'wonderful example of negative space, but crop closer to bring it out. Hint: your negative space is on the right side of the frame, not the left!', '2007-06-21 21:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817646, 539446, 50695, '<td valign="top">Negative space does not exist in emptiness. Positive shapes and borders create negative space.</td>', 'Negative space does not exist in emptiness. Positive shapes and borders create negative space.', '2007-06-21 21:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817649, 538442, 50695, '<td valign="top">an obtusely angled geometric shape does not create interesting negative space. Nice bokeh, though.</td>', 'an obtusely angled geometric shape does not create interesting negative space. Nice bokeh, though.', '2007-06-21 21:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817726, 540134, 70514, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful dog.  I find the wrinkles in the BG distracting, though.</td>', 'What a beautiful dog.  I find the wrinkles in the BG distracting, though.', '2007-06-21 21:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817730, 540175, 70514, '<td valign="top">How beautiful and simple.  I love the texture and water you kept so visible!  Very nice colors and composition too!</td>', 'How beautiful and simple.  I love the texture and water you kept so visible!  Very nice colors and composition too!', '2007-06-21 21:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817735, 539609, 70514, '<td valign="top">I like the processing and leading lines in this image.  What a unique subject!</td>', 'I like the processing and leading lines in this image.  What a unique subject!', '2007-06-21 21:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817737, 539986, 70514, '<td valign="top">It looks slightly oof, to me.</td>', 'It looks slightly oof, to me.', '2007-06-21 21:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817746, 536439, 7786, '<td valign="top">You are bold to post a photo in this ratio here! But I like it, its creative, fits the challenge well, good colors and sharpness. -7-</td>', 'You are bold to post a photo in this ratio here! But I like it, its creative, fits the challenge well, good colors and sharpness. -7-', '2007-06-21 21:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817921, 538872, 50695, '<td valign="top">the extreme processing and the centering of the wire emphasize the negative space. ok.</td>', 'the extreme processing and the centering of the wire emphasize the negative space. ok.', '2007-06-21 22:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817923, 539777, 50695, '<td valign="top">Good use of negative space.</td>', 'Good use of negative space.', '2007-06-21 22:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817928, 539395, 50695, '<td valign="top">making the foreground look like the background does create an interesting sense of negative space in an unusual way.</td>', 'making the foreground look like the background does create an interesting sense of negative space in an unusual way.', '2007-06-21 22:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817939, 539364, 50695, '<td valign="top">cool photo! but the uninteresting negative space is actually a weakness of the photo. perhaps cropping off some of the right would help.</td>', 'cool photo! but the uninteresting negative space is actually a weakness of the photo. perhaps cropping off some of the right would help.', '2007-06-21 22:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817946, 540161, 50695, '<td valign="top">crop closer to the subject to get a sense of NS</td>', 'crop closer to the subject to get a sense of NS', '2007-06-21 22:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817950, 540093, 50695, '<td valign="top">crop off the top to get a better sense of shape in your negative space. size doesn''t matter.</td>', 'crop off the top to get a better sense of shape in your negative space. size doesn''t matter.', '2007-06-21 22:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817957, 539789, 50695, '<td valign="top">no interesting NS here. all the interest is in the subject.</td>', 'no interesting NS here. all the interest is in the subject.', '2007-06-21 22:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817958, 539288, 50695, '<td valign="top">a round little subject in the corner does not make for interesting NS</td>', 'a round little subject in the corner does not make for interesting NS', '2007-06-21 22:32:33.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3817961, 538635, 50695, '<td valign="top">hell yeah! by limiting the tones you create a powerful sense of positive vs. negative space. 10</td>', 'hell yeah! by limiting the tones you create a powerful sense of positive vs. negative space. 10', '2007-06-21 22:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817967, 538438, 50695, '<td valign="top">good shape on the child creates nice NS near the subject, but crop closer so he divides the canvas into sections.</td>', 'good shape on the child creates nice NS near the subject, but crop closer so he divides the canvas into sections.', '2007-06-21 22:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817975, 539666, 50695, '<td valign="top">solid example of negative space.</td>', 'solid example of negative space.', '2007-06-21 22:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817979, 539589, 50695, '<td valign="top">good negative space around the vegetation, but all that empty space detracts.</td>', 'good negative space around the vegetation, but all that empty space detracts.', '2007-06-21 22:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817988, 539622, 50695, '<td valign="top">the shadow is a great shape. I''ll consider that your negative space. I''d crop off some of the right.</td>', 'the shadow is a great shape. I''ll consider that your negative space. I''d crop off some of the right.', '2007-06-21 22:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3817997, 539504, 50695, '<td valign="top">pretty good if not dramatic negative space.</td>', 'pretty good if not dramatic negative space.', '2007-06-21 22:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3818026, 538465, 50695, '<td valign="top">Good negative space on the left side. Get rid of the right side.</td>', 'Good negative space on the left side. Get rid of the right side.', '2007-06-21 22:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3818028, 535088, 50695, '<td valign="top">good use of NS</td>', 'good use of NS', '2007-06-21 22:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3818033, 540005, 50695, '<td valign="top">Not much NS here. It''s all crowded into the lower left.</td>', 'Not much NS here. It''s all crowded into the lower left.', '2007-06-21 22:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3818036, 539152, 50695, '<td valign="top">No interesting cuts into the sky make for no interesting NS</td>', 'No interesting cuts into the sky make for no interesting NS', '2007-06-21 22:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3818043, 539426, 50695, '<td valign="top">pretty standard bird shape, but it does create some negative space</td>', 'pretty standard bird shape, but it does create some negative space', '2007-06-21 22:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3818044, 540102, 50695, '<td valign="top">strong highlight line creates shapes of negative space. good.</td>', 'strong highlight line creates shapes of negative space. good.', '2007-06-21 22:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3818045, 539327, 50695, '<td valign="top">some good negative space hiding in the corner there. crop closer to it.</td>', 'some good negative space hiding in the corner there. crop closer to it.', '2007-06-21 22:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3818049, 539001, 50695, '<td valign="top">The negative space is where the shapes are. If you cram the shapes into a corner, you do the same thing with your negative space. (very nice corner, though)</td>', 'The negative space is where the shapes are. If you cram the shapes into a corner, you do the same thing with your negative space. (very nice corner, though)', '2007-06-21 22:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3818065, 539594, 50695, '<td valign="top">a circle in the corner does not make for interesting negative space.</td>', 'a circle in the corner does not make for interesting negative space.', '2007-06-21 22:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3818071, 539986, 50695, '<td valign="top">fascinating. in addition to the composition, the missing shoe also represents a sort of negative space. 10</td>', 'fascinating. in addition to the composition, the missing shoe also represents a sort of negative space. 10', '2007-06-21 22:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3818120, 539323, 50695, '<td valign="top">not terribly original but it does rely on negative space for interest.</td>', 'not terribly original but it does rely on negative space for interest.', '2007-06-21 23:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3818133, 538667, 50695, '<td valign="top">compositionally, the negative space is not so exciting, but it is balanced and nice to look at. the real importance of negative space here is that the subject gets lost in it, but also reflects in it, but also is hiding underneath the "positive" space of the lily pad. This complex interplay of negative and positive space garners you a 10 from me.</td>', 'compositionally, the negative space is not so exciting, but it is balanced and nice to look at. the real importance of negative space here is that the subject gets lost in it, but also reflects in it, but also is hiding underneath the "positive" space of the lily pad. This complex interplay of negative and positive space garners you a 10 from me.', '2007-06-21 23:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3818149, 539894, 50695, '<td valign="top">good minimal use of negative space. the minimal approach rarely works, at least in this challenge.</td>', 'good minimal use of negative space. the minimal approach rarely works, at least in this challenge.', '2007-06-21 23:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3818153, 539940, 50695, '<td valign="top">Nice dreamy negative space.</td>', 'Nice dreamy negative space.', '2007-06-21 23:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3818184, 539832, 1908, '<td valign="top">Nice photo i like would love to see this photo at night though would be stunning</td>', 'Nice photo i like would love to see this photo at night though would be stunning', '2007-06-21 23:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3818188, 540172, 50695, '<td valign="top">having something in the background that showed through the ice(?) would make for some interesting NS. This shot has none.</td>', 'having something in the background that showed through the ice(?) would make for some interesting NS. This shot has none.', '2007-06-21 23:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3818194, 537706, 50695, '<td valign="top">show us the face. that''s where the negative space is.</td>', 'show us the face. that''s where the negative space is.', '2007-06-21 23:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3818200, 538874, 50695, '<td valign="top">nice twirling shape on the kite creates interesting NS. crop closer to it!</td>', 'nice twirling shape on the kite creates interesting NS. crop closer to it!', '2007-06-21 23:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3818209, 538693, 50695, '<td valign="top">big blurry sky is not enough to make negative space. negative space require an interesting positive to set it off.</td>', 'big blurry sky is not enough to make negative space. negative space require an interesting positive to set it off.', '2007-06-21 23:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3818212, 535666, 50695, '<td valign="top">Yes! Excellent understanding of negative space. 10</td>', 'Yes! Excellent understanding of negative space. 10', '2007-06-21 23:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3818216, 539851, 50695, '<td valign="top">the sky looks positive to me. I don''t see any NS</td>', 'the sky looks positive to me. I don''t see any NS', '2007-06-21 23:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3818226, 539523, 50695, '<td valign="top">there''s some interplay of negative space in the dandelion, but it is demolished by all the emptiness to the right of it.</td>', 'there''s some interplay of negative space in the dandelion, but it is demolished by all the emptiness to the right of it.', '2007-06-21 23:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
