(3821861, 540102, 3087, '<td valign="top">That is just gorgeous. The light on the edge of that cloud, with the variation of colours and the wonderful shapes, and the beautiful boat in almost full silhouette but with just a few details retained... and the blue of that cloud... it''s just gorgeous.</td>', 'That is just gorgeous. The light on the edge of that cloud, with the variation of colours and the wonderful shapes, and the beautiful boat in almost full silhouette but with just a few details retained... and the blue of that cloud... it''s just gorgeous.', '2007-06-22 21:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
