(3822031, 536231, 1024, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo, not only does it meet the challenge, but it tells a story at the same time.</td>', 'Wonderful photo, not only does it meet the challenge, but it tells a story at the same time.', '2007-06-22 22:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3822034, 538975, 1024, '<td valign="top">Elegantly High Key.</td>', 'Elegantly High Key.', '2007-06-22 22:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3822124, 539609, 6349, '<td valign="top">well, I say, that''s a lot of hats!  This is easily my favorite photograph in the challenge.  However, I don''t think it''s great in terms of negative space.  In fact, what I like about this photo is that it is great despite the lack of negative space.  There is barely anywhere on the ground without a hat.  And the only part of the photo without hats has an equally strange addition, a man with a broken down car.  Makes one wonder what it has to do with the hats.  Is the man a hat salesman who likes to display his best prize-winning top-of-the-line hat under the hood of his car like a little shrine or is this simply a man who enjoys collecting hats who is having automobile trouble in the middle of a move who is throwing all his hats out of the car (yet keeping them organized in piles (according to what I can''t decide) in preparation for transferring them to his friend''s car who has offered him a ride?</td>', 'well, I say, that''s a lot of hats!  This is easily my favorite photograph in the challenge.  However, I don''t think it''s great in terms of negative space.  In fact, what I like about this photo is that it is great despite the lack of negative space.  There is barely anywhere on the ground without a hat.  And the only part of the photo without hats has an equally strange addition, a man with a broken down car.  Makes one wonder what it has to do with the hats.  Is the man a hat salesman who likes to display his best prize-winning top-of-the-line hat under the hood of his car like a little shrine or is this simply a man who enjoys collecting hats who is having automobile trouble in the middle of a move who is throwing all his hats out of the car (yet keeping them organized in piles (according to what I can''t decide) in preparation for transferring them to his friend''s car who has offered him a ride?', '2007-06-22 22:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3822128, 536674, 6349, '<td valign="top">Top shot in the challenge.  Hope to see this ribbon.</td>', 'Top shot in the challenge.  Hope to see this ribbon.', '2007-06-22 22:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3822132, 539182, 6349, '<td valign="top">very nice.  I would like to see the highlights on you a little more white than grey but regardless this is one of my top picks in the challenge.  great work.</td>', 'very nice.  I would like to see the highlights on you a little more white than grey but regardless this is one of my top picks in the challenge.  great work.', '2007-06-22 22:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3822149, 535930, 1024, '<td valign="top">I wish there was a way to mark this so I would remember to come back and see how it placed.  This is definitely "artsy" and "out of the box" and personally I hope it places very high.  Unfortunately most DPCers do not see things the way I do.  Good luck!!  I am cheering you (and this image) on.</td>', 'I wish there was a way to mark this so I would remember to come back and see how it placed.  This is definitely "artsy" and "out of the box" and personally I hope it places very high.  Unfortunately most DPCers do not see things the way I do.  Good luck!!  I am cheering you (and this image) on.', '2007-06-22 22:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3822214, 539018, 63244, '<td valign="top">The negative space is good, but the picture is a bit dark.  The top of the hand and the coin need more light.  Good stop action.</td>', 'The negative space is good, but the picture is a bit dark.  The top of the hand and the coin need more light.  Good stop action.', '2007-06-22 22:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3822220, 538863, 63244, '<td valign="top">The color is a bit odd.  I like the eyes on the model, but the hands are covering a bit more face than is necessary.  Neg. space is good.</td>', 'The color is a bit odd.  I like the eyes on the model, but the hands are covering a bit more face than is necessary.  Neg. space is good.', '2007-06-22 22:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3822224, 539294, 63244, '<td valign="top">very nice colors.  i like the border also.  It adds interest.</td>', 'very nice colors.  i like the border also.  It adds interest.', '2007-06-22 22:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3822227, 537074, 63244, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is such a neat shot, but I wish the bird wasn''t so far into the corner.  Nice choice on the border.</td>', 'Oh, this is such a neat shot, but I wish the bird wasn''t so far into the corner.  Nice choice on the border.', '2007-06-22 22:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3822237, 540108, 63244, '<td valign="top">The purple, blue in the sky doesn''t go with the tones of the rest of the photograph.  The bright spot detracts from the neat little building below.</td>', 'The purple, blue in the sky doesn''t go with the tones of the rest of the photograph.  The bright spot detracts from the neat little building below.', '2007-06-22 23:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3822239, 540076, 52130, '<td valign="top">i love blue!</td>', 'i love blue!', '2007-06-22 23:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3822241, 539794, 63244, '<td valign="top">Neg. space is good.  The focus on this shot is really odd and unfortunately, not in an interesting way (IMO).  Maybe a bit deeper DOF.  I do like the b&amp;W.</td>', 'Neg. space is good.  The focus on this shot is really odd and unfortunately, not in an interesting way (IMO).  Maybe a bit deeper DOF.  I do like the b&W.', '2007-06-22 23:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3822244, 535992, 52130, '<td valign="top">oh! the places you''ll go! :)</td>', 'oh! the places you''ll go! :)', '2007-06-22 23:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3822253, 538222, 63244, '<td valign="top">The side lighting is a bit harsh for the model and her soft dress. It is casting a bright shine on the right side of her face.  Would like to be able to see a little more detail on the left eye.  It might have worked w/out the lightbulb and same model as neg. space is good here. Softer light would give the "little girl and pink dress" look a bit more childlike features.  Does that make sense? It''s not a bad photograph by any means! :)</td>', 'The side lighting is a bit harsh for the model and her soft dress. It is casting a bright shine on the right side of her face.  Would like to be able to see a little more detail on the left eye.  It might have worked w/out the lightbulb and same model as neg. space is good here. Softer light would give the "little girl and pink dress" look a bit more childlike features.  Does that make sense? It''s not a bad photograph by any means! :)', '2007-06-22 23:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3822258, 539574, 63244, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Wish the cityscape were a bit further up from the bottom of the photograph. Mean looking storm!</td>', 'I like this.  Wish the cityscape were a bit further up from the bottom of the photograph. Mean looking storm!', '2007-06-22 23:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3822264, 539091, 63244, '<td valign="top">Unusual capture.  To bad it wasn''t really early or really late in the day to give you a different light on the subject.</td>', 'Unusual capture.  To bad it wasn''t really early or really late in the day to give you a different light on the subject.', '2007-06-22 23:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3822270, 537055, 63244, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and the natural framing.  The border also ads. Nice use of neg. space.</td>', 'I love the colors and the natural framing.  The border also ads. Nice use of neg. space.', '2007-06-22 23:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3822272, 539759, 63244, '<td valign="top">Nice bokeh on this shot!</td>', 'Nice bokeh on this shot!', '2007-06-22 23:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
