(3822989, 538668, 63244, '<td valign="top">This is really nice. Perhaps crop just a touch of the bottom right corner to take the subject out of the dead center.  Excellent lighting and focus is spot on.</td>', 'This is really nice. Perhaps crop just a touch of the bottom right corner to take the subject out of the dead center.  Excellent lighting and focus is spot on.', '2007-06-23 01:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
