(3823098, 539238, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 2/2<br/>Composition: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 2/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 2/2<br/> <br/>Excellent work. I''m not a big fan of the limited DOF for this shot, but it doesn''t really detract from the image either. Your negative space definitely adds the impact that this photo needs. Nice job.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 2/2Composition: 2/2Photo Quality: 2/2My Subjective Affinity: 2/2 Excellent work. I''m not a big fan of the limited DOF for this shot, but it doesn''t really detract from the image either. Your negative space definitely adds the impact that this photo needs. Nice job.', '2007-06-23 01:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3823100, 538566, 63244, '<td valign="top">This is great in b&amp;w.  Nice detail.</td>', 'This is great in b&w.  Nice detail.', '2007-06-23 01:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3823103, 540097, 63244, '<td valign="top">Nice composition choice.</td>', 'Nice composition choice.', '2007-06-23 01:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3823106, 539832, 63244, '<td valign="top">This is interesting! I like the colors.  The detail is very good and I like the simplicity.</td>', 'This is interesting! I like the colors.  The detail is very good and I like the simplicity.', '2007-06-23 01:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3823119, 538106, 63244, '<td valign="top">The lines are very interesting. They are almost too interesting to make this negative space. Nice capture.</td>', 'The lines are very interesting. They are almost too interesting to make this negative space. Nice capture.', '2007-06-23 01:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3823122, 539227, 63244, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait.  Beautiful colors.</td>', 'Very nice portrait.  Beautiful colors.', '2007-06-23 01:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3823127, 538853, 63244, '<td valign="top">Sepia works for this one.</td>', 'Sepia works for this one.', '2007-06-23 01:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3823128, 538960, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 0/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 1/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>This photo does have negative space, but there is no impact in it at all. The only real impact is the subject''s blue eyes. The white sheet needs to be whiter, and the red hat also lacks the vivid colors that would really make that stand out.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 0/2Contrast/Color: 1/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 This photo does have negative space, but there is no impact in it at all. The only real impact is the subject''s blue eyes. The white sheet needs to be whiter, and the red hat also lacks the vivid colors that would really make that stand out.', '2007-06-23 01:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3823132, 536701, 63244, '<td valign="top">This is interesting. I love the side light on this. The brick details adds interest to the negative space.  Well done!</td>', 'This is interesting. I love the side light on this. The brick details adds interest to the negative space.  Well done!', '2007-06-23 01:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3823136, 537527, 42577, '<td valign="top">i like the contrast b/w the new brick and the old brick but i''m not sure if that''s what you were going for...</td>', 'i like the contrast b/w the new brick and the old brick but i''m not sure if that''s what you were going for...', '2007-06-23 01:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3823161, 540128, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 2/2<br/>Composition: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 2/2<br/> <br/>I really like your composition on this shot. It is excellent. My only dislike: the moon is a bit overexposed. The grey gradient is excellent.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 2/2Composition: 2/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 2/2 I really like your composition on this shot. It is excellent. My only dislike: the moon is a bit overexposed. The grey gradient is excellent.', '2007-06-23 01:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3823177, 539208, 23458, '<td valign="top">Great background, composition and expression. Lighting is good for the most part, though perhaps a little harsh on his head. Overall a striking image. 8.</td>', 'Great background, composition and expression. Lighting is good for the most part, though perhaps a little harsh on his head. Overall a striking image. 8.', '2007-06-23 01:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3823195, 539362, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is quite effective. I think, however, it would gain a lot if you''d captured slightly more foreground - the image needs something to anchor the tree. 6.</td>', 'This is quite effective. I think, however, it would gain a lot if you''d captured slightly more foreground - the image needs something to anchor the tree. 6.', '2007-06-23 02:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3823205, 538863, 23458, '<td valign="top">The lighting here is suitably moody - well done on that front. I think, however, that you''ve gone a little overboard on the eyes. The skin tones also look a little unnatural. 7.</td>', 'The lighting here is suitably moody - well done on that front. I think, however, that you''ve gone a little overboard on the eyes. The skin tones also look a little unnatural. 7.', '2007-06-23 02:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3823217, 539559, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 1/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 1/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 0/2<br/> <br/>The idea is nice, and the negative space supports the subject well, but it lacks any real punch to make this shot stand out above the rest. The shadows are too dark. It would be much better to see a small bit of detail throughout the photo to tell more of the story.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 1/2Contrast/Color: 1/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 0/2 The idea is nice, and the negative space supports the subject well, but it lacks any real punch to make this shot stand out above the rest. The shadows are too dark. It would be much better to see a small bit of detail throughout the photo to tell more of the story.', '2007-06-23 02:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3823220, 540034, 23458, '<td valign="top">The composition here is solid, but, unfortunately the lighting is a bit flat. A plain white or black background would also have worked better.</td>', 'The composition here is solid, but, unfortunately the lighting is a bit flat. A plain white or black background would also have worked better.', '2007-06-23 02:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3823226, 536084, 23458, '<td valign="top">Well the urchin is an interesting subject - and it''s very well lit. Other than that this shot just seems a little static. I''m not sure that the negative space is really adding anything either. 7</td>', 'Well the urchin is an interesting subject - and it''s very well lit. Other than that this shot just seems a little static. I''m not sure that the negative space is really adding anything either. 7', '2007-06-23 02:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3823234, 538421, 23458, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition - great tones. There''s a couple of little distractions that I''d love to see removed, but this is obviously a basic editing challenge so I won''t hold those against you. 8.</td>', 'Excellent composition - great tones. There''s a couple of little distractions that I''d love to see removed, but this is obviously a basic editing challenge so I won''t hold those against you. 8.', '2007-06-23 02:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3823237, 539858, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is simple yet effective. The green contrasts particularly well with the flower. 8.</td>', 'This is simple yet effective. The green contrasts particularly well with the flower. 8.', '2007-06-23 02:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3823256, 538635, 23458, '<td valign="top">Everything about this shot seems slightly askew. The title (intentional?). The almost centered composition. The strange cloud formation. Still, there''s something about it that draws the viewer in. 7</td>', 'Everything about this shot seems slightly askew. The title (intentional?). The almost centered composition. The strange cloud formation. Still, there''s something about it that draws the viewer in. 7', '2007-06-23 02:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3823263, 538106, 23458, '<td valign="top">No I can''t. But you get a 7 for finding a model who can. Terrific location for a shot like this.</td>', 'No I can''t. But you get a 7 for finding a model who can. Terrific location for a shot like this.', '2007-06-23 02:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3823302, 539990, 23458, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic. Great composition - particularly the use of lines. 8.</td>', 'Very dramatic. Great composition - particularly the use of lines. 8.', '2007-06-23 02:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3823314, 538872, 23458, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Very graphic. 8.</td>', 'Excellent. Very graphic. 8.', '2007-06-23 02:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3823318, 538414, 23458, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea - would be improved by better focus and perhaps a bit more contrast.</td>', 'Not a bad idea - would be improved by better focus and perhaps a bit more contrast.', '2007-06-23 02:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3823321, 536701, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is terrific. The lighting and compostition are spot on. What appears to be exposed butt-crack is perhaps a little distracting, but you cant have it all your own way. 8.</td>', 'This is terrific. The lighting and compostition are spot on. What appears to be exposed butt-crack is perhaps a little distracting, but you cant have it all your own way. 8.', '2007-06-23 02:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3823335, 537074, 23458, '<td valign="top">I always like these types of shots, and this is no exception. The light on the water going across the frame in the foreground perhaps distracts slightly from the subject but overall this is an effective image.</td>', 'I always like these types of shots, and this is no exception. The light on the water going across the frame in the foreground perhaps distracts slightly from the subject but overall this is an effective image.', '2007-06-23 02:37:37.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3823343, 539559, 23458, '<td valign="top">Terrific concept, executed with a deft touch. Well done. Would perhaps like some more light cast on her head but this is one of the best of the 70 odd I''ve voted on so far.</td>', 'Terrific concept, executed with a deft touch. Well done. Would perhaps like some more light cast on her head but this is one of the best of the 70 odd I''ve voted on so far.', '2007-06-23 02:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3823346, 539942, 23458, '<td valign="top">Fantastic detail. Striking lighting. 8.</td>', 'Fantastic detail. Striking lighting. 8.', '2007-06-23 02:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3823348, 538533, 23458, '<td valign="top">Very well composed, stunning scene. There are several similar shots on this site (same waterfall perhaps) which perhaps detracts from the impact slightly, but this remains one of the best in the challenge.</td>', 'Very well composed, stunning scene. There are several similar shots on this site (same waterfall perhaps) which perhaps detracts from the impact slightly, but this remains one of the best in the challenge.', '2007-06-23 02:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3823351, 537245, 23458, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and composition. Perhaps not tack sharp, but effective nonetheless.</td>', 'Great lighting and composition. Perhaps not tack sharp, but effective nonetheless.', '2007-06-23 02:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3823355, 540052, 23458, '<td valign="top">Well the blood looks outrageously fake. But the concept is terrific, the composition is spot on and the skid-mark adds a nice (if implausible) touch. My favourite so far.</td>', 'Well the blood looks outrageously fake. But the concept is terrific, the composition is spot on and the skid-mark adds a nice (if implausible) touch. My favourite so far.', '2007-06-23 02:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3823359, 538562, 23458, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, cool make-up etc. The expression looks a little forced which detracts slightly from the overall impact, but this remains a strong shot.</td>', 'Great lighting, cool make-up etc. The expression looks a little forced which detracts slightly from the overall impact, but this remains a strong shot.', '2007-06-23 02:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3823362, 538222, 23458, '<td valign="top">Good concept. Unfortunately, it loses much of its impact on account of the poor focus. You''re obviously got the creativity (which is the hard part) - just got to get the technicals right.</td>', 'Good concept. Unfortunately, it loses much of its impact on account of the poor focus. You''re obviously got the creativity (which is the hard part) - just got to get the technicals right.', '2007-06-23 02:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3823365, 539182, 23458, '<td valign="top">Awesome. Great perspective, lighting is almost flawless. Deserves a top five for sure. A trail of smoke from the cigarette would have pushed this into 10 territory. As it is you''ll have to settle for my nine.</td>', 'Awesome. Great perspective, lighting is almost flawless. Deserves a top five for sure. A trail of smoke from the cigarette would have pushed this into 10 territory. As it is you''ll have to settle for my nine.', '2007-06-23 02:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
