(3825245, 539142, 31637, '<td valign="top">I tried this over and over this past week. Same composition, except I just can''t get a low moon where I am and was at the time. This is so excellent. I''m very jealous. I usually never envy one''s work like I do with this.  10</td>', 'I tried this over and over this past week. Same composition, except I just can''t get a low moon where I am and was at the time. This is so excellent. I''m very jealous. I usually never envy one''s work like I do with this.  10', '2007-06-23 18:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
