(3827990, 538665, 77537, '<td valign="top">picasso &amp;hemmingway are on a yacht. hemmingway takes out a bottle and a gun.<br/>picasso goes to get his painting stuff. when he comes back, h. has finished the bottle and is lying drunk on the deck. picasso goes to get his guitar. when he comes back hemmingway is fishing pulling a big fish out of the water picasso goes to get a club and a knife. when he comes back hemmingway is writing in his notebook. picasso goes to get his girlfriend. when he comes back he cant find hemmingway anywhere. picasso goes to get something to eat. when he comes back, hemmingway is jumping overboard. picasso goes to get the captain. when they come back they . . .<br/> okay you just earned an 8.</td>', 'picasso &hemmingway are on a yacht. hemmingway takes out a bottle and a gun.picasso goes to get his painting stuff. when he comes back, h. has finished the bottle and is lying drunk on the deck. picasso goes to get his guitar. when he comes back hemmingway is fishing pulling a big fish out of the water picasso goes to get a club and a knife. when he comes back hemmingway is writing in his notebook. picasso goes to get his girlfriend. when he comes back he cant find hemmingway anywhere. picasso goes to get something to eat. when he comes back, hemmingway is jumping overboard. picasso goes to get the captain. when they come back they . . . okay you just earned an 8.', '2007-06-24 16:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
