(3828601, 539432, 36382, '<td valign="top">Interesting color choice for the background, but I do like it because it is different to what you would expect.  I like the ''shininess'' of his skin, especially on his arms.  Maybe the spot on his forehead would be better if it was less bright.  I really like his confident stare.  Overall I like this a lot. 8.</td>', 'Interesting color choice for the background, but I do like it because it is different to what you would expect.  I like the ''shininess'' of his skin, especially on his arms.  Maybe the spot on his forehead would be better if it was less bright.  I really like his confident stare.  Overall I like this a lot. 8.', '2007-06-24 18:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3828603, 540133, 36382, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors.</td>', 'Beautiful colors.', '2007-06-24 18:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3828616, 538533, 36382, '<td valign="top">This is a good picture.  I''d love to have this photo op.  I wish that they had on bright jackets, instead of the bright helmet.  That just seems a little strange to me.  I like how the water is all misty around them, and the difference in scale is awesome.</td>', 'This is a good picture.  I''d love to have this photo op.  I wish that they had on bright jackets, instead of the bright helmet.  That just seems a little strange to me.  I like how the water is all misty around them, and the difference in scale is awesome.', '2007-06-24 18:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3828707, 539213, 63244, '<td valign="top">Love the contrast and the details! Simple, yet interesting.</td>', 'Love the contrast and the details! Simple, yet interesting.', '2007-06-24 19:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
