(3828719, 539208, 63244, '<td valign="top">I think this portrait is good.  Great colors and detail. (I might have powdere his head first.)  Not a fan of the border as it is.  It detracts from an otherwise nice photograph.</td>', 'I think this portrait is good.  Great colors and detail. (I might have powdere his head first.)  Not a fan of the border as it is.  It detracts from an otherwise nice photograph.', '2007-06-24 19:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
