(3829003, 539710, 70484, '<td valign="top">So simple, but elegant and beautiful! I would probably like it even better if it was cropped a little tighter to get the rocks in the lower left corner out of the picture. I still think it would have been enough negative space and possibly even enhanced it with only the lady being in the water. 9</td>', 'So simple, but elegant and beautiful! I would probably like it even better if it was cropped a little tighter to get the rocks in the lower left corner out of the picture. I still think it would have been enough negative space and possibly even enhanced it with only the lady being in the water. 9', '2007-06-24 21:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3829004, 539395, 70484, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture! I love how the sea and the sky are practically the same color. 9</td>', 'Very nice capture! I love how the sea and the sky are practically the same color. 9', '2007-06-24 21:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
