(3832229, 536122, 66398, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image but the rock or land in front really ruins it for me as an image overall. I know the reason for it is because of the challenge needing to have negative space but to me it detracts from the shot overall and doesn''t add to it. Just too much black in an otherwise beautiful shot for me.</td>', 'This is a beautiful image but the rock or land in front really ruins it for me as an image overall. I know the reason for it is because of the challenge needing to have negative space but to me it detracts from the shot overall and doesn''t add to it. Just too much black in an otherwise beautiful shot for me.', '2007-06-25 14:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832233, 539749, 70, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture - it has lovely light that makes a rather ordinary subject interesting, but I don''t really consider this negative space.</td>', 'I really like this picture - it has lovely light that makes a rather ordinary subject interesting, but I don''t really consider this negative space.', '2007-06-25 14:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832234, 538466, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity on the subject.</td>', 'Nice clarity on the subject.', '2007-06-25 14:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832242, 539143, 70, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t really give me a sense of negative space and the image is underexposed a fair amount.</td>', 'This doesn''t really give me a sense of negative space and the image is underexposed a fair amount.', '2007-06-25 14:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832261, 538443, 70, '<td valign="top">This strikes me more as just an item on a backdrop than any sort of negative space. Personally, I''m not too fond of waterdrops on flowers in a studio setting either because it just doesn''t make sense.</td>', 'This strikes me more as just an item on a backdrop than any sort of negative space. Personally, I''m not too fond of waterdrops on flowers in a studio setting either because it just doesn''t make sense.', '2007-06-25 14:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832264, 538443, 66398, '<td valign="top">Acording to the title, the focus of your image is the ring in the middle of the rose and having it dead center of the image doesn''t help imo. It also looks like the focus was clear on the bg but not on the subject (the ring and the rose). Possible ways to make this image better IMO is to have the crop more up and to the right so that the rose is even not all in the shot but so that the ring is in the lower left two thirds position and having more of the satiny bg in the shot. Having the ring more in focus would also help.</td>', 'Acording to the title, the focus of your image is the ring in the middle of the rose and having it dead center of the image doesn''t help imo. It also looks like the focus was clear on the bg but not on the subject (the ring and the rose). Possible ways to make this image better IMO is to have the crop more up and to the right so that the rose is even not all in the shot but so that the ring is in the lower left two thirds position and having more of the satiny bg in the shot. Having the ring more in focus would also help.', '2007-06-25 14:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832265, 537180, 70, '<td valign="top">Nice - the negative space creates feeling here...</td>', 'Nice - the negative space creates feeling here...', '2007-06-25 14:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832295, 537525, 66398, '<td valign="top">Makes me think of the movie (Alfred Hitchcock I think?). A little lightening on the shadows and midtone contrast may help this image a bit imo.</td>', 'Makes me think of the movie (Alfred Hitchcock I think?). A little lightening on the shadows and midtone contrast may help this image a bit imo.', '2007-06-25 15:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832297, 539142, 52549, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image. The stars are amazing.</td>', 'Wonderful image. The stars are amazing.', '2007-06-25 15:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832301, 539348, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very rich and vivid color, and  the DOF is very elegant.  An amazingly beautiful photograph!</td>', 'Very rich and vivid color, and  the DOF is very elegant.  An amazingly beautiful photograph!', '2007-06-25 15:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832304, 539621, 70, '<td valign="top">I really like this - one of the few where the negative space actually adds to the photo. I thought maybe I''d like it better without the street light actually in it but I think that would give it too much of a studio feel so maybe not. Nicely done.</td>', 'I really like this - one of the few where the negative space actually adds to the photo. I thought maybe I''d like it better without the street light actually in it but I think that would give it too much of a studio feel so maybe not. Nicely done.', '2007-06-25 15:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832305, 539001, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nice. Wish there were clouds in the sky that day. Would''ve added more drama to the shot imo but that''s obviously not something you can control. More contrast might have helped it a bit though in pp.</td>', 'Nice. Wish there were clouds in the sky that day. Would''ve added more drama to the shot imo but that''s obviously not something you can control. More contrast might have helped it a bit though in pp.', '2007-06-25 15:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832306, 539422, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very George Michaels-esque portrait.  Very nice job on the lighting with this photo.  Well done!</td>', 'Very George Michaels-esque portrait.  Very nice job on the lighting with this photo.  Well done!', '2007-06-25 15:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832307, 539887, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity on the subject but the tree sort of detracts a bit imo. Cute little guy.</td>', 'Nice clarity on the subject but the tree sort of detracts a bit imo. Cute little guy.', '2007-06-25 15:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832308, 536419, 42100, '<td valign="top">Really nice job on the motion blur in this photo.  It has a very modern cinematic feel to it.  Very nice photo!</td>', 'Really nice job on the motion blur in this photo.  It has a very modern cinematic feel to it.  Very nice photo!', '2007-06-25 15:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832317, 537591, 42100, '<td valign="top">Lots of great elements to this photo...texture, pattern and a strong splash of color.  Excellent photo!</td>', 'Lots of great elements to this photo...texture, pattern and a strong splash of color.  Excellent photo!', '2007-06-25 15:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832325, 539516, 66398, '<td valign="top">Your subject looks a little washed out to me and she doesn''t look like she''s napping but just happened to blink during the shot.</td>', 'Your subject looks a little washed out to me and she doesn''t look like she''s napping but just happened to blink during the shot.', '2007-06-25 15:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832326, 539561, 42100, '<td valign="top">A wedding photo I assume...and a very good too!  I really like this creative and original take.  Nicely done!</td>', 'A wedding photo I assume...and a very good too!  I really like this creative and original take.  Nicely done!', '2007-06-25 15:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832338, 539182, 51793, '<td valign="top">I love that song.</td>', 'I love that song.', '2007-06-25 15:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832342, 540032, 42100, '<td valign="top">This is exactly what people think of when they think of the Golden Gates.  Those bright orange towers and the pea soup fog.  Very nice photo!</td>', 'This is exactly what people think of when they think of the Golden Gates.  Those bright orange towers and the pea soup fog.  Very nice photo!', '2007-06-25 15:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832351, 539704, 42100, '<td valign="top">A very unusual, but neat backdrop for your model.  She''s maybe a little too centered for my tastes, but a very excellent photo with some excellent b&amp;w tones!</td>', 'A very unusual, but neat backdrop for your model.  She''s maybe a little too centered for my tastes, but a very excellent photo with some excellent b&w tones!', '2007-06-25 15:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832354, 539378, 42100, '<td valign="top">Those clouds really make that boat look like a small toy.  Some great tones captured in that sky.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Those clouds really make that boat look like a small toy.  Some great tones captured in that sky.  Nicely done!', '2007-06-25 15:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832364, 539971, 66398, '<td valign="top">Try darkening and increasing contrast and midtones. This is a great idea but could be a little better processed imo.</td>', 'Try darkening and increasing contrast and midtones. This is a great idea but could be a little better processed imo.', '2007-06-25 15:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832367, 539622, 70, '<td valign="top">Ha ha! Your title really works with this. I like it. :)</td>', 'Ha ha! Your title really works with this. I like it. :)', '2007-06-25 15:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832368, 538414, 71951, '<td valign="top">Creative, but seems slightly OOF to me.</td>', 'Creative, but seems slightly OOF to me.', '2007-06-25 15:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832371, 540002, 71951, '<td valign="top">Good creativity, nice textures.</td>', 'Good creativity, nice textures.', '2007-06-25 15:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832374, 539990, 71951, '<td valign="top">Nice contrasting colors.</td>', 'Nice contrasting colors.', '2007-06-25 15:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832378, 538946, 71951, '<td valign="top">Nice reflecting colors, good clarity on your subject. A very nice photo, but I find the great water &amp; reflections taking away from the subject.</td>', 'Nice reflecting colors, good clarity on your subject. A very nice photo, but I find the great water & reflections taking away from the subject.', '2007-06-25 15:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832380, 537591, 70, '<td valign="top">Mmmm...love it. Love to see it in b&amp;w, too.</td>', 'Mmmm...love it. Love to see it in b&w, too.', '2007-06-25 15:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832385, 539517, 71951, '<td valign="top">I think a shallow DOF would have worked better for a Negative Space photo. A blurred green background would have made the pretty flowers pop out at you. Very nice photo though.</td>', 'I think a shallow DOF would have worked better for a Negative Space photo. A blurred green background would have made the pretty flowers pop out at you. Very nice photo though.', '2007-06-25 15:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832390, 536354, 71951, '<td valign="top">Harsh lighting is hurting this one. The subject seems slightly OOF.</td>', 'Harsh lighting is hurting this one. The subject seems slightly OOF.', '2007-06-25 15:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832395, 540175, 71951, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Nice contrasting colors and clarity.</td>', 'Great composition. Nice contrasting colors and clarity.', '2007-06-25 15:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832398, 539214, 71951, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, too bad he wasn''t bright green to add even more impact to the photo.</td>', 'Nicely done, too bad he wasn''t bright green to add even more impact to the photo.', '2007-06-25 15:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832401, 538479, 71951, '<td valign="top">Nice creativity, good colors. Great job.</td>', 'Nice creativity, good colors. Great job.', '2007-06-25 15:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832404, 538669, 71951, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo, I think this works really well for this challenge. Good job.</td>', 'Very nice photo, I think this works really well for this challenge. Good job.', '2007-06-25 15:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832407, 539942, 71951, '<td valign="top">Cool photo, very creative, my favorite so far.</td>', 'Cool photo, very creative, my favorite so far.', '2007-06-25 15:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832411, 540062, 71951, '<td valign="top">Great DOF, nice colors.</td>', 'Great DOF, nice colors.', '2007-06-25 15:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832413, 539594, 71951, '<td valign="top">I always like these...they are so photogenic. Nice job. The black Neg. Space works great with this.</td>', 'I always like these...they are so photogenic. Nice job. The black Neg. Space works great with this.', '2007-06-25 15:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
