(3832424, 539622, 71951, '<td valign="top">Good one, nice and creative and nicely done.</td>', 'Good one, nice and creative and nicely done.', '2007-06-25 15:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832425, 538715, 66398, '<td valign="top">Not my idea of negative space. I see what you were going for though so I don''t consider it dnmc. The fisherman which I believe is the intended subject isn''t very clear though. I''m guessing you were trying to have the bg show his aloneness?</td>', 'Not my idea of negative space. I see what you were going for though so I don''t consider it dnmc. The fisherman which I believe is the intended subject isn''t very clear though. I''m guessing you were trying to have the bg show his aloneness?', '2007-06-25 15:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832426, 539832, 70, '<td valign="top">D''oh, stupid light post but otherwise awesome!</td>', 'D''oh, stupid light post but otherwise awesome!', '2007-06-25 15:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832429, 539368, 66398, '<td valign="top">neg space is too minimal imo.</td>', 'neg space is too minimal imo.', '2007-06-25 15:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832447, 539404, 66398, '<td valign="top">Good idea but the boy is too oof and I''m not liking the car in the upper left. Might be worth trying a reshoot where you have a boy such as this one "pose" as if he is smiling at the boys in the painting and not holding a plastic bag of soda cans but maybe a paper bag of something (popcorn maybe).</td>', 'Good idea but the boy is too oof and I''m not liking the car in the upper left. Might be worth trying a reshoot where you have a boy such as this one "pose" as if he is smiling at the boys in the painting and not holding a plastic bag of soda cans but maybe a paper bag of something (popcorn maybe).', '2007-06-25 15:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832454, 539965, 66398, '<td valign="top">Wish the bird had more clarity.</td>', 'Wish the bird had more clarity.', '2007-06-25 15:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832458, 540133, 66398, '<td valign="top">Too oof imo.</td>', 'Too oof imo.', '2007-06-25 15:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832463, 538533, 70, '<td valign="top">Is that a motorcycle helmet or what? It makes me feel a little like they are aliens on some bizarre planet. Nicely composed. The small bit of white between them (a remnant of tonemapping or s/h perhaps?) has a rather strong pull on my eye but not much you can do about that in basic.</td>', 'Is that a motorcycle helmet or what? It makes me feel a little like they are aliens on some bizarre planet. Nicely composed. The small bit of white between them (a remnant of tonemapping or s/h perhaps?) has a rather strong pull on my eye but not much you can do about that in basic.', '2007-06-25 15:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832465, 539208, 66398, '<td valign="top">A little too hot on his forehead. You might be able to fix that by reducing highlights a little. Overall good use of neg space and not a bad shot.</td>', 'A little too hot on his forehead. You might be able to fix that by reducing highlights a little. Overall good use of neg space and not a bad shot.', '2007-06-25 15:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832472, 538568, 66398, '<td valign="top">a little more contrast might make her pop better.</td>', 'a little more contrast might make her pop better.', '2007-06-25 15:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832473, 539574, 29474, '<td valign="top">This is a brilliant image ... up to half way through the dark cloud. Everything above that is superflous and takes the eye out of the image.</td>', 'This is a brilliant image ... up to half way through the dark cloud. Everything above that is superflous and takes the eye out of the image.', '2007-06-25 15:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832475, 537767, 66398, '<td valign="top">The bg is too bright imo.</td>', 'The bg is too bright imo.', '2007-06-25 15:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832481, 539297, 29474, '<td valign="top">Sometimes too much negative space doesn''t work. I think that this would have been a better picture if cropped about halfway up.</td>', 'Sometimes too much negative space doesn''t work. I think that this would have been a better picture if cropped about halfway up.', '2007-06-25 15:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832483, 536914, 66398, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little work on shadows and highlights would help this shot some.</td>', 'Maybe a little work on shadows and highlights would help this shot some.', '2007-06-25 15:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832492, 539777, 66398, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast in this shot. She''s in white in a dark bg and he''s in dark colors in a white bg. The whites are a little blown imo though. Great idea and not what I originally considered as neg space but it works very well for this challenge imo. Just needs less blowout on the highlights for me.</td>', 'I like the contrast in this shot. She''s in white in a dark bg and he''s in dark colors in a white bg. The whites are a little blown imo though. Great idea and not what I originally considered as neg space but it works very well for this challenge imo. Just needs less blowout on the highlights for me.', '2007-06-25 16:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832496, 539036, 66398, '<td valign="top">nice idea. The play of light on the wall works for the challenge but the technicals aren''t good enough for me. It''s not very clear and the light itself is a little too hot for my taste.</td>', 'nice idea. The play of light on the wall works for the challenge but the technicals aren''t good enough for me. It''s not very clear and the light itself is a little too hot for my taste.', '2007-06-25 16:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832505, 540170, 66398, '<td valign="top">works for the challenge and technicals not bad. Just not one of the best images in the challenge imo.</td>', 'works for the challenge and technicals not bad. Just not one of the best images in the challenge imo.', '2007-06-25 16:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832512, 537066, 66398, '<td valign="top">Not in favor of the angle/tilt you chose.</td>', 'Not in favor of the angle/tilt you chose.', '2007-06-25 16:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832533, 540092, 66398, '<td valign="top">Not liking the oof lights at the bottom. It draws my eye to it right away when the tree should be what draws my attention first. I do like the color of the bg though. It adds to the shot.</td>', 'Not liking the oof lights at the bottom. It draws my eye to it right away when the tree should be what draws my attention first. I do like the color of the bg though. It adds to the shot.', '2007-06-25 16:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832537, 536771, 66398, '<td valign="top">The sky is too blown imo not adding to but detracting from the shot.</td>', 'The sky is too blown imo not adding to but detracting from the shot.', '2007-06-25 16:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832546, 539954, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nice. Lightening shadows, and midtone contrast may have brought the bird out a little better though.</td>', 'Nice. Lightening shadows, and midtone contrast may have brought the bird out a little better though.', '2007-06-25 16:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832554, 539300, 74747, '<td valign="top">One of my 10''s! Wonderful image!</td>', 'One of my 10''s! Wonderful image!', '2007-06-25 16:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832555, 535871, 74747, '<td valign="top">One of my 10''s! The detail is simply amazing in this photograph! Nice job!</td>', 'One of my 10''s! The detail is simply amazing in this photograph! Nice job!', '2007-06-25 16:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
