(3832560, 538872, 74747, '<td valign="top">My fav in the challenge! Wish I could have taken a photo like this! The negative space really does it''s purpose - making the cardinal "pop." Love the title also! Nice job!</td>', 'My fav in the challenge! Wish I could have taken a photo like this! The negative space really does it''s purpose - making the cardinal "pop." Love the title also! Nice job!', '2007-06-25 16:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
