(3832653, 539894, 29474, '<td valign="top">Beautiful effect on this picture. But I am a little confused by the lighting. How were the carrots lit? Surely not with the same light that lit the plate?</td>', 'Beautiful effect on this picture. But I am a little confused by the lighting. How were the carrots lit? Surely not with the same light that lit the plate?', '2007-06-25 16:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3832660, 540175, 42100, '<td valign="top">The vase and flower really look interesting against the rough cut boards, and the pink of the petals makes a bold statement.  Nicely done!</td>', 'The vase and flower really look interesting against the rough cut boards, and the pink of the petals makes a bold statement.  Nicely done!', '2007-06-25 16:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
