(3832674, 537527, 29474, '<td valign="top">You are the lucky recipient of my 1000th comment.<br/> <br/>I don''t like the sky and all the wires. They really distract from what is a good image. A crop below the shadow on the top of the wall seems to give this more impact.</td>', 'You are the lucky recipient of my 1000th comment. I don''t like the sky and all the wires. They really distract from what is a good image. A crop below the shadow on the top of the wall seems to give this more impact.', '2007-06-25 16:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
