(3833348, 540202, 66398, '<td valign="top">Yes it is. And you have negative space but the shot is''nt a stand out to me. sorry.</td>', 'Yes it is. And you have negative space but the shot is''nt a stand out to me. sorry.', '2007-06-25 20:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
