(3833374, 539088, 66398, '<td valign="top">and cost saving too.</td>', 'and cost saving too.', '2007-06-25 20:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833378, 539440, 66398, '<td valign="top">what a beautiful shot. There could be more neg space but this is very nice.</td>', 'what a beautiful shot. There could be more neg space but this is very nice.', '2007-06-25 20:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833381, 539666, 66398, '<td valign="top">A very beautiful shot but not much in the way of neg space. The neg space that is there doesn''t really add to the wow of the shot imo. The flower is beautiful and the image is a nice one overall. 6</td>', 'A very beautiful shot but not much in the way of neg space. The neg space that is there doesn''t really add to the wow of the shot imo. The flower is beautiful and the image is a nice one overall. 6', '2007-06-25 20:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833395, 538960, 64994, '<td valign="top">Neat idea. For me the cloth backdrop hurts this with the wrinkles, maybe if it were further back and blurred out it would help or if it were say black and out of focus. Just a few thoughts, anyway very sharp and good exposure control, great idea! 6</td>', 'Neat idea. For me the cloth backdrop hurts this with the wrinkles, maybe if it were further back and blurred out it would help or if it were say black and out of focus. Just a few thoughts, anyway very sharp and good exposure control, great idea! 6', '2007-06-25 20:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833398, 539661, 64994, '<td valign="top">Something very compelling about this...8</td>', 'Something very compelling about this...8', '2007-06-25 20:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833401, 539574, 64994, '<td valign="top">Nice!! 8</td>', 'Nice!! 8', '2007-06-25 20:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833405, 539713, 64994, '<td valign="top">Cool idea!! 8</td>', 'Cool idea!! 8', '2007-06-25 20:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833411, 539786, 64994, '<td valign="top">You can have some of mine, it''s done nothing but rain here for at least a month!! Cool shot!! Love the tones and the bokehed background...8</td>', 'You can have some of mine, it''s done nothing but rain here for at least a month!! Cool shot!! Love the tones and the bokehed background...8', '2007-06-25 20:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833417, 537956, 64994, '<td valign="top">Nice!!  8</td>', 'Nice!!  8', '2007-06-25 20:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833423, 538044, 64994, '<td valign="top">Cool!! 7</td>', 'Cool!! 7', '2007-06-25 20:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833429, 537804, 64994, '<td valign="top">Very nice! love the sky! 9</td>', 'Very nice! love the sky! 9', '2007-06-25 20:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833445, 538958, 64994, '<td valign="top">Just a little blown out for my tastes, if you are looking for more detail you might try setting the camera at around f8 and about 125sec, this is where I start out and then adjust up or down based on test shots, just a thought. good composition and has a rather errie feel...6</td>', 'Just a little blown out for my tastes, if you are looking for more detail you might try setting the camera at around f8 and about 125sec, this is where I start out and then adjust up or down based on test shots, just a thought. good composition and has a rather errie feel...6', '2007-06-25 20:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833450, 537641, 64994, '<td valign="top">Ribbon for me, this ROCKS!!! 10</td>', 'Ribbon for me, this ROCKS!!! 10', '2007-06-25 20:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833456, 537591, 64994, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  8</td>', 'Nice shot!  8', '2007-06-25 20:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833465, 539956, 64994, '<td valign="top">I''m jealous...mine are still green!! Very nice shot! love the colors..9</td>', 'I''m jealous...mine are still green!! Very nice shot! love the colors..9', '2007-06-25 20:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833479, 539208, 64994, '<td valign="top">Love the title! lol. nice shot! 8</td>', 'Love the title! lol. nice shot! 8', '2007-06-25 20:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833503, 535992, 47852, '<td valign="top">Oh, The Places You''ll Go?  I like the added little spikes sticking inward in some of the holes.</td>', 'Oh, The Places You''ll Go?  I like the added little spikes sticking inward in some of the holes.', '2007-06-25 20:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833505, 539432, 44877, '<td valign="top">What''s Serge''s phone number?</td>', 'What''s Serge''s phone number?', '2007-06-25 20:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833520, 539528, 66398, '<td valign="top">Not sure how to evaluate this one. The title tells me the sky is your subject but the challenge is supposed to be a shot where the bg (negative space) makes your subject stand out more. At least that''s how I interpret it. If you had some subject in this shot with the sky as the bg then it might fit the challenge better imo. If you intend the tree to be the subject and the sky the bg then it works for the challenge but for me the brown line to the left of the bench and the white building? between the trees above the bench sort of detract from the shot. It is a pretty sky and the shot isn''t bad. It just doesn''t stand out as one of the better images to me. 5</td>', 'Not sure how to evaluate this one. The title tells me the sky is your subject but the challenge is supposed to be a shot where the bg (negative space) makes your subject stand out more. At least that''s how I interpret it. If you had some subject in this shot with the sky as the bg then it might fit the challenge better imo. If you intend the tree to be the subject and the sky the bg then it works for the challenge but for me the brown line to the left of the bench and the white building? between the trees above the bench sort of detract from the shot. It is a pretty sky and the shot isn''t bad. It just doesn''t stand out as one of the better images to me. 5', '2007-06-25 20:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833536, 539517, 66398, '<td valign="top">Moving the camera up and to the right a bit to put the flowers lower to the left might help this a little.</td>', 'Moving the camera up and to the right a bit to put the flowers lower to the left might help this a little.', '2007-06-25 20:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833543, 535663, 66398, '<td valign="top">nice lighting and composition.</td>', 'nice lighting and composition.', '2007-06-25 20:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833573, 540136, 76373, '<td valign="top">I like the photo and the crispness, but the border is a bit too much.</td>', 'I like the photo and the crispness, but the border is a bit too much.', '2007-06-25 20:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833580, 539704, 66398, '<td valign="top">I don''t get wow from that bg but okay. Is that a plane? Where is she? IMO the wow of this shot is her beauty and the lighting on her. 5</td>', 'I don''t get wow from that bg but okay. Is that a plane? Where is she? IMO the wow of this shot is her beauty and the lighting on her. 5', '2007-06-25 20:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833583, 539380, 76373, '<td valign="top">Bit too much contrast, my eye gets pulled in many different directions.  If you toned that down a bit it may be very interesting composition.</td>', 'Bit too much contrast, my eye gets pulled in many different directions.  If you toned that down a bit it may be very interesting composition.', '2007-06-25 20:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833585, 535345, 47852, '<td valign="top">I wonder how many people got your KISS acronym... "keep it simple stupid" and the thimble in Peter Pan?  Took a few seconds to put it all together for me.</td>', 'I wonder how many people got your KISS acronym... "keep it simple stupid" and the thimble in Peter Pan?  Took a few seconds to put it all together for me.', '2007-06-25 20:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833593, 539754, 66398, '<td valign="top">A little more contrast, midtones and saturation may have helped a little here.</td>', 'A little more contrast, midtones and saturation may have helped a little here.', '2007-06-25 20:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833603, 539142, 47852, '<td valign="top">Hmm, interesting how you captured all of the trails in the sky yet no motion in the stars.  Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Hmm, interesting how you captured all of the trails in the sky yet no motion in the stars.  Beautiful shot.', '2007-06-25 20:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833604, 540014, 47852, '<td valign="top">Beautiful silhouette... like the unique color you''ve chosen here for the background.  Only thing I would have changed was that little ol'' splotch of dust.  Very nice!</td>', 'Beautiful silhouette... like the unique color you''ve chosen here for the background.  Only thing I would have changed was that little ol'' splotch of dust.  Very nice!', '2007-06-25 20:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833614, 539357, 66398, '<td valign="top">Great example of how the bg/neg space creates the wow. Maybe a faster shutter speed would have gotten them more in focus though.</td>', 'Great example of how the bg/neg space creates the wow. Maybe a faster shutter speed would have gotten them more in focus though.', '2007-06-25 20:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833621, 539829, 66398, '<td valign="top">They''re just a little hot but not distractingly so. Nice shot.</td>', 'They''re just a little hot but not distractingly so. Nice shot.', '2007-06-25 20:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833623, 536231, 76373, '<td valign="top">Awesome! Beautiful colors throughout.  9</td>', 'Awesome! Beautiful colors throughout.  9', '2007-06-25 21:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833628, 540175, 66398, '<td valign="top">Technicals look good and it meets the challenge well. Nice shot.</td>', 'Technicals look good and it meets the challenge well. Nice shot.', '2007-06-25 21:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833642, 535930, 66398, '<td valign="top">This would have been nice if there was an in focus subject near the foreground.</td>', 'This would have been nice if there was an in focus subject near the foreground.', '2007-06-25 21:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833655, 538992, 66398, '<td valign="top">You know how ya make shapes out of the clouds? Well I see a head here. The flowers are the eyes and the horizontal line on the vase is the mouth and the base of the vase is the shoulders. I know not helpful. OK seriously. The technicals are okay. There could be better focus on the vase but everything else looks good and the neg space works well for the shot.</td>', 'You know how ya make shapes out of the clouds? Well I see a head here. The flowers are the eyes and the horizontal line on the vase is the mouth and the base of the vase is the shoulders. I know not helpful. OK seriously. The technicals are okay. There could be better focus on the vase but everything else looks good and the neg space works well for the shot.', '2007-06-25 21:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833669, 540076, 66398, '<td valign="top">Or Tomasina? This would work better if either she weren''t wearing blue or the wall was a different color. The blue on blue just doesn''t work for this shot imo.</td>', 'Or Tomasina? This would work better if either she weren''t wearing blue or the wall was a different color. The blue on blue just doesn''t work for this shot imo.', '2007-06-25 21:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833685, 538931, 66398, '<td valign="top">I used to take them apart or take the stickers off and move them. Focus here isn''t very sharp. Try increasing contrast to bring this out a little more.</td>', 'I used to take them apart or take the stickers off and move them. Focus here isn''t very sharp. Try increasing contrast to bring this out a little more.', '2007-06-25 21:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833691, 539447, 66398, '<td valign="top">Looks a little oversharpened. Its pretty noisy on my screen.</td>', 'Looks a little oversharpened. Its pretty noisy on my screen.', '2007-06-25 21:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833698, 538201, 66398, '<td valign="top">Can''t put my finger on what to improve but, this one just doesn''t do anything for me. I like the title. the composition looks good The lighting seems to be okay. I honestly don''t have any suggestions for improvement except maybe a more interesting subject? sorry. 5</td>', 'Can''t put my finger on what to improve but, this one just doesn''t do anything for me. I like the title. the composition looks good The lighting seems to be okay. I honestly don''t have any suggestions for improvement except maybe a more interesting subject? sorry. 5', '2007-06-25 21:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833707, 536419, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nice panning shot. This shows motion very well.</td>', 'Nice panning shot. This shows motion very well.', '2007-06-25 21:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833713, 540107, 66398, '<td valign="top">Maybe this would get more of a wow if the bottom half inch of the shot had land, or spectators or horizon. Not bad as it is just saying what I think would improve it.</td>', 'Maybe this would get more of a wow if the bottom half inch of the shot had land, or spectators or horizon. Not bad as it is just saying what I think would improve it.', '2007-06-25 21:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833722, 539018, 66398, '<td valign="top">A little more lighting would''ve helped this. Focus could have been clearer.</td>', 'A little more lighting would''ve helped this. Focus could have been clearer.', '2007-06-25 21:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833727, 538880, 66398, '<td valign="top">oversharpened and still not clear enough.</td>', 'oversharpened and still not clear enough.', '2007-06-25 21:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833735, 539749, 66398, '<td valign="top">So if grass is the subject then theres no bg/neg space. And if grass is the bg/neg space then theres no subject for it to give wow to. Somethings missing imo. but its a nice shot of grass.</td>', 'So if grass is the subject then theres no bg/neg space. And if grass is the bg/neg space then theres no subject for it to give wow to. Somethings missing imo. but its a nice shot of grass.', '2007-06-25 21:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833743, 536425, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Why b/w though. I would think the color in the sky would add to the wow of it. Did it just not have great colors in it?</td>', 'Nice shot. Why b/w though. I would think the color in the sky would add to the wow of it. Did it just not have great colors in it?', '2007-06-25 21:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833751, 536691, 66398, '<td valign="top">The border is detracting, the shot is oof, there is no bg to speak of that would add any wow to it. Did you take this with a cell phone? What is it?</td>', 'The border is detracting, the shot is oof, there is no bg to speak of that would add any wow to it. Did you take this with a cell phone? What is it?', '2007-06-25 21:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833761, 537804, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nice colors in the sky.</td>', 'Nice colors in the sky.', '2007-06-25 21:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833789, 540072, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nothing in this shot is bad imo but nothing is interesting enough to give it higher than a 5. Sorry.</td>', 'Nothing in this shot is bad imo but nothing is interesting enough to give it higher than a 5. Sorry.', '2007-06-25 21:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833798, 538703, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.</td>', 'Nice lighting.', '2007-06-25 21:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833808, 539602, 66398, '<td valign="top">I think the crop is a bit tight on the bottom and each side. Maybe a little pool in the shot would help. The bg doesn''t give any wow imo but it does give it neg space to fit the challenge.</td>', 'I think the crop is a bit tight on the bottom and each side. Maybe a little pool in the shot would help. The bg doesn''t give any wow imo but it does give it neg space to fit the challenge.', '2007-06-25 21:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833831, 539025, 66398, '<td valign="top">What is it really? Some areas of this shot are a little too hot for my taste.</td>', 'What is it really? Some areas of this shot are a little too hot for my taste.', '2007-06-25 21:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833837, 540097, 66398, '<td valign="top">Better lighting on the flag would help this. Try increasing contrast and see if that doesn''t bring it out a little more. Maybe a little work in levels.</td>', 'Better lighting on the flag would help this. Try increasing contrast and see if that doesn''t bring it out a little more. Maybe a little work in levels.', '2007-06-25 21:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833848, 537290, 66398, '<td valign="top">The crop is a little tight on the bottom imo. And there are no colors really adding to this shot so maybe try b/w? It might add a better feel to the shot too.</td>', 'The crop is a little tight on the bottom imo. And there are no colors really adding to this shot so maybe try b/w? It might add a better feel to the shot too.', '2007-06-25 21:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833860, 539594, 66398, '<td valign="top">This is nice but I think I''m on dandelion overload. (I won''t let that affect my vote though I promise) Maybe try getting some wind going and get this same shot with some of the pods in air? Just for something different.</td>', 'This is nice but I think I''m on dandelion overload. (I won''t let that affect my vote though I promise) Maybe try getting some wind going and get this same shot with some of the pods in air? Just for something different.', '2007-06-25 21:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833877, 539234, 58615, '<td valign="top">The colors in this image is what really catches my eye, not the negative space. But I''m ok with that. Great picture.</td>', 'The colors in this image is what really catches my eye, not the negative space. But I''m ok with that. Great picture.', '2007-06-25 21:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833893, 539894, 23458, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept and creative lighting. The negative space is used particularly well here.</td>', 'Interesting concept and creative lighting. The negative space is used particularly well here.', '2007-06-25 21:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833895, 538931, 58615, '<td valign="top">I haven''t had great luck with my experience in rubik''s cube images. But I hope you do well and that is a nice cube.</td>', 'I haven''t had great luck with my experience in rubik''s cube images. But I hope you do well and that is a nice cube.', '2007-06-25 21:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833910, 539564, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is extremely appealing - the vingette effect works particularly well. Terrific comp to boot. 8.</td>', 'This is extremely appealing - the vingette effect works particularly well. Terrific comp to boot. 8.', '2007-06-25 21:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833928, 539954, 23098, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but the negative space seems to draw the eye away from the Jay, otherwise it would be a strong and dramatic photo.</td>', 'Nice shot but the negative space seems to draw the eye away from the Jay, otherwise it would be a strong and dramatic photo.', '2007-06-25 22:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3833996, 539986, 23098, '<td valign="top">Nice negative space shot, wish the shoe was a little more in focus.</td>', 'Nice negative space shot, wish the shoe was a little more in focus.', '2007-06-25 22:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834016, 539997, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nothing jumps out at me in the negative or positive on this shot. It meets the challenge and the technicals are fine it just doesn''t capture me.</td>', 'Nothing jumps out at me in the negative or positive on this shot. It meets the challenge and the technicals are fine it just doesn''t capture me.', '2007-06-25 22:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834028, 539279, 66398, '<td valign="top">A little hot on the left.</td>', 'A little hot on the left.', '2007-06-25 22:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
