(3834033, 538044, 66398, '<td valign="top">A different color bg would bring him out a little better imo. He''s pretty though.</td>', 'A different color bg would bring him out a little better imo. He''s pretty though.', '2007-06-25 22:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
