(3834104, 540155, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.', '2007-06-25 22:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834111, 539428, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nice image but for me the neg space isn''t enough and doesn''t give it wow imo. 5</td>', 'Nice image but for me the neg space isn''t enough and doesn''t give it wow imo. 5', '2007-06-25 22:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834118, 539552, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nothing here looks like neg space imo.</td>', 'Nothing here looks like neg space imo.', '2007-06-25 22:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834121, 535992, 66398, '<td valign="top">Interesting.</td>', 'Interesting.', '2007-06-25 22:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834140, 539512, 66398, '<td valign="top">Don''t know how to improve this but it isn''t a shot that really grabs me. Maybe if the plane wasn''t centered?</td>', 'Don''t know how to improve this but it isn''t a shot that really grabs me. Maybe if the plane wasn''t centered?', '2007-06-25 23:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834143, 540005, 66398, '<td valign="top">He''s a little overexposed imo. nice use of neg space though.</td>', 'He''s a little overexposed imo. nice use of neg space though.', '2007-06-25 23:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834149, 538899, 66398, '<td valign="top">What a sweet little face.</td>', 'What a sweet little face.', '2007-06-25 23:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834157, 540189, 66398, '<td valign="top">Too much subject and not enough neg space? Not sure but for me it is. Nice clarity.</td>', 'Too much subject and not enough neg space? Not sure but for me it is. Nice clarity.', '2007-06-25 23:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834175, 539643, 66398, '<td valign="top">nice shot.</td>', 'nice shot.', '2007-06-25 23:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834181, 538967, 66398, '<td valign="top">This image looks all awash imo. Try some contrast and work with midtones. Nice composition though and great neg space idea.</td>', 'This image looks all awash imo. Try some contrast and work with midtones. Nice composition though and great neg space idea.', '2007-06-25 23:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834184, 536915, 66398, '<td valign="top">A little overexposed imo and not very clear on the flower.</td>', 'A little overexposed imo and not very clear on the flower.', '2007-06-25 23:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834197, 539548, 66398, '<td valign="top">Personally I''d consider the leaves as part of the subject which doesn''t really leave much for neg space so I''m guessing you considered the leaves as the neg space and the subject is the flower only. The colors of everything else gives pop to the flower and the composition brings is out as well.</td>', 'Personally I''d consider the leaves as part of the subject which doesn''t really leave much for neg space so I''m guessing you considered the leaves as the neg space and the subject is the flower only. The colors of everything else gives pop to the flower and the composition brings is out as well.', '2007-06-25 23:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834201, 540002, 66398, '<td valign="top">If the deck is the subject (as indicated by the title) then where''s the neg space. Be careful with the title. I think you intended the deck as the neg space so your title should be something that draws attention to the brush which would then be the subject.</td>', 'If the deck is the subject (as indicated by the title) then where''s the neg space. Be careful with the title. I think you intended the deck as the neg space so your title should be something that draws attention to the brush which would then be the subject.', '2007-06-25 23:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834204, 538635, 66398, '<td valign="top">This could be improved by putting the sheep more into a thirds position imo. The sky nor the ground seam to add to the shot imo.</td>', 'This could be improved by putting the sheep more into a thirds position imo. The sky nor the ground seam to add to the shot imo.', '2007-06-25 23:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834207, 536454, 66398, '<td valign="top">The sticks look like birds in flight with their reflections.</td>', 'The sticks look like birds in flight with their reflections.', '2007-06-25 23:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834208, 539873, 66398, '<td valign="top">It''s a pretty umbrella.</td>', 'It''s a pretty umbrella.', '2007-06-25 23:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834231, 539641, 66398, '<td valign="top">I think the title could have helped you here if you had titled it something like property''s edge. The barbed wire is a prominent item in the shot and the building in the bg as well as the sunset would be great negative space to bring out the meaning in that title. My eyes are naturally drawn to the wire here anyway with this composition and lighting so why not use it to your advantage and make it the focal point in the title too which leaves the rest of the image as the bg... thus the neg space thus meeting the challenge. The wire could use a little more clarity/focus though.</td>', 'I think the title could have helped you here if you had titled it something like property''s edge. The barbed wire is a prominent item in the shot and the building in the bg as well as the sunset would be great negative space to bring out the meaning in that title. My eyes are naturally drawn to the wire here anyway with this composition and lighting so why not use it to your advantage and make it the focal point in the title too which leaves the rest of the image as the bg... thus the neg space thus meeting the challenge. The wire could use a little more clarity/focus though.', '2007-06-25 23:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834247, 539614, 66398, '<td valign="top">Okay I''ll bite... What do radio waves have to do with color? You might have gotten a better shot here if it were late afternoon or early morning but this seems to have been shot midday?</td>', 'Okay I''ll bite... What do radio waves have to do with color? You might have gotten a better shot here if it were late afternoon or early morning but this seems to have been shot midday?', '2007-06-25 23:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834326, 536691, 75034, '<td valign="top">It would help if we had some idea of the subject matter. A little focous here would do wonders. Is this in the wrong challenge by any chance? Could you ahve been looking for the macro? If so I would guess that it is a wire rope connection with a burndy connecter and by the looks of it you have done what is commomnly refered to as saddling a dead horse. Or in other words put the burndy on the wrong way. You always put the saddle (the part you tighted the bolts on) on the live wire. <br/>Good luck and happy shooting.</td>', 'It would help if we had some idea of the subject matter. A little focous here would do wonders. Is this in the wrong challenge by any chance? Could you ahve been looking for the macro? If so I would guess that it is a wire rope connection with a burndy connecter and by the looks of it you have done what is commomnly refered to as saddling a dead horse. Or in other words put the burndy on the wrong way. You always put the saddle (the part you tighted the bolts on) on the live wire. Good luck and happy shooting.', '2007-06-25 23:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834367, 539208, 67697, '<td valign="top">Your subject does make you want to look into the empty space to see what might be happening there.  I like the background as well.  Also curious about why he is dressed the way he is.  Interesting photo!</td>', 'Your subject does make you want to look into the empty space to see what might be happening there.  I like the background as well.  Also curious about why he is dressed the way he is.  Interesting photo!', '2007-06-25 23:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834372, 539764, 67697, '<td valign="top">Awww cute.  Love that just the tiny haad is in focus.  lol is this where it is appropriate to use the word "bokeh"?  Looks good.</td>', 'Awww cute.  Love that just the tiny haad is in focus.  lol is this where it is appropriate to use the word "bokeh"?  Looks good.', '2007-06-25 23:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834381, 539348, 67697, '<td valign="top">Great closeup and capture of the bubble.  I love the colorful background and also that you can see a reflection in the bubble.  Nice!</td>', 'Great closeup and capture of the bubble.  I love the colorful background and also that you can see a reflection in the bubble.  Nice!', '2007-06-25 23:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834403, 536674, 67697, '<td valign="top">You know - this is funny.  I cannot believe I am about to write the following because I cringed when someone did it to me.  But now I actually understand.  I would have just gone with a simple title and let the viewer decide what kinds of gaps could be created here.  Before I read your title, I saw the visual gap between the men and then I looked at the two men.  My first thought was actually about job status.  Like the working man on the right and what - a student or homeless person on the left?  A very cool photo with lots to look at.  Nice!</td>', 'You know - this is funny.  I cannot believe I am about to write the following because I cringed when someone did it to me.  But now I actually understand.  I would have just gone with a simple title and let the viewer decide what kinds of gaps could be created here.  Before I read your title, I saw the visual gap between the men and then I looked at the two men.  My first thought was actually about job status.  Like the working man on the right and what - a student or homeless person on the left?  A very cool photo with lots to look at.  Nice!', '2007-06-25 23:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834406, 537290, 67697, '<td valign="top">Lovely clouds.  Would have liked to see a little more of the plane.</td>', 'Lovely clouds.  Would have liked to see a little more of the plane.', '2007-06-25 23:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834425, 537591, 67697, '<td valign="top">Love the blue umbrella and the textures of the pavement.  Love that you can see the puddles as well.</td>', 'Love the blue umbrella and the textures of the pavement.  Love that you can see the puddles as well.', '2007-06-26 00:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834428, 538454, 67697, '<td valign="top">Simply a captivating photo.  Love the black and white and the lighting is awesome.  This certainly makes you want to hear his story.</td>', 'Simply a captivating photo.  Love the black and white and the lighting is awesome.  This certainly makes you want to hear his story.', '2007-06-26 00:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834431, 539371, 67697, '<td valign="top">Is this a dandelion?  Great closeup!  Lovely lighting and it is nice that you can still see the details in the yellow parts (I always have a hard time photographing yellow petals.)  Nice!</td>', 'Is this a dandelion?  Great closeup!  Lovely lighting and it is nice that you can still see the details in the yellow parts (I always have a hard time photographing yellow petals.)  Nice!', '2007-06-26 00:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834439, 539621, 67697, '<td valign="top">Oooh was this staged or a true candid?  Love the lighting from the lamp and the parts shining on the musician.</td>', 'Oooh was this staged or a true candid?  Love the lighting from the lamp and the parts shining on the musician.', '2007-06-26 00:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834444, 539404, 67697, '<td valign="top">How cool - catching the boys (real and artistic) this way.  Also love that the painted man seems to be waving at the real boy.  Great catch!</td>', 'How cool - catching the boys (real and artistic) this way.  Also love that the painted man seems to be waving at the real boy.  Great catch!', '2007-06-26 00:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834462, 536585, 67697, '<td valign="top">Looks like a great place to have lunch!</td>', 'Looks like a great place to have lunch!', '2007-06-26 00:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834465, 540175, 67697, '<td valign="top">The inclusion of the smaller white petals is interesting.  Love the color tones of this shot.</td>', 'The inclusion of the smaller white petals is interesting.  Love the color tones of this shot.', '2007-06-26 00:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834474, 539792, 67697, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  Love how it is about to jump out of the pic.</td>', 'Very pretty.  Love how it is about to jump out of the pic.', '2007-06-26 00:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834479, 539786, 67697, '<td valign="top">We need some rain too.  Interesting choice for the subject of a photo.  I like the background as well.</td>', 'We need some rain too.  Interesting choice for the subject of a photo.  I like the background as well.', '2007-06-26 00:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834484, 538414, 67697, '<td valign="top">Good idea but it seems a little blurry to me.  Also, playing around with the contrast some might take away some of the gray and create more of a definition bewteen black and white.</td>', 'Good idea but it seems a little blurry to me.  Also, playing around with the contrast some might take away some of the gray and create more of a definition bewteen black and white.', '2007-06-26 00:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834510, 540032, 67697, '<td valign="top">Cool use of fog.  Like how the lines lead you right to the empty space.</td>', 'Cool use of fog.  Like how the lines lead you right to the empty space.', '2007-06-26 00:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834523, 539182, 67697, '<td valign="top">Ha - love the title.  Love the dark tones and the selective lighting.</td>', 'Ha - love the title.  Love the dark tones and the selective lighting.', '2007-06-26 00:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834526, 539559, 67697, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Love the heart shadow and the innocence of the child who is sitting on the floor.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Love the heart shadow and the innocence of the child who is sitting on the floor.', '2007-06-26 00:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834532, 539917, 67697, '<td valign="top">heh - great expression.  Pure joy I hope!</td>', 'heh - great expression.  Pure joy I hope!', '2007-06-26 00:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834537, 539832, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is cool - love how you made this look like it is sitting in the middle of nowhere.</td>', 'This is cool - love how you made this look like it is sitting in the middle of nowhere.', '2007-06-26 00:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834542, 538562, 67697, '<td valign="top">Really don''t like pics like these because of the kind of emotion it conveys.  Good match with the neg space and also think the red eyes is a good addition.</td>', 'Really don''t like pics like these because of the kind of emotion it conveys.  Good match with the neg space and also think the red eyes is a good addition.', '2007-06-26 00:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834603, 539609, 50695, '<td valign="top">hands down<br/> <br/>this is the best negative space photo I''ve seen so far. This is a complex paradise of negative space, plus the thematic negative space of hats without heads. Brilliant. 10<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/> <br/>posthumous blue ribbon for you</td>', 'hands down this is the best negative space photo I''ve seen so far. This is a complex paradise of negative space, plus the thematic negative space of hats without heads. Brilliant. 10  posthumous blue ribbon for you', '2007-06-26 00:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834610, 539025, 50695, '<td valign="top">wow. you redefine negative space. 10<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/> <br/> <br/>posthumous red ribbon for you.</td>', 'wow. you redefine negative space. 10   posthumous red ribbon for you.', '2007-06-26 00:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834621, 536701, 50695, '<td valign="top">excellent pulse of positive and negative space. 10<br/> <br/>it''s like he''s riding into a world of stars. even with the buttcrack, this is a posthumous yeloow ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'excellent pulse of positive and negative space. 10 it''s like he''s riding into a world of stars. even with the buttcrack, this is a posthumous yeloow ribbon. ', '2007-06-26 00:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834899, 539966, 66398, '<td valign="top">This is pretty grainy but I''m going to assume you intended it that way. I actually like the dim lighting but the bg doesn''t seem to add a lot to the shot imo.</td>', 'This is pretty grainy but I''m going to assume you intended it that way. I actually like the dim lighting but the bg doesn''t seem to add a lot to the shot imo.', '2007-06-26 02:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834900, 539637, 66398, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I wouldn''t have thought to do anything like this. Its way out there but seems to work for the challenge imo.</td>', 'Interesting. I wouldn''t have thought to do anything like this. Its way out there but seems to work for the challenge imo.', '2007-06-26 02:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834901, 539609, 66398, '<td valign="top">This shot is too busy for my taste and I don''t really see negative space here.</td>', 'This shot is too busy for my taste and I don''t really see negative space here.', '2007-06-26 02:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834906, 539986, 66398, '<td valign="top">Pretty wood floor. Hope you find your other shoe. Not sure you''ll be able to get them on your feet though cause... *looks around to see if anyone''s listening and then whisper*... I think its a dog chew toy.</td>', 'Pretty wood floor. Hope you find your other shoe. Not sure you''ll be able to get them on your feet though cause... *looks around to see if anyone''s listening and then whisper*... I think its a dog chew toy.', '2007-06-26 02:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834914, 540111, 66398, '<td valign="top">Now thats some nice neg space. I love bricks. I think I''d have titled it "window pie"... but that''s just me.</td>', 'Now thats some nice neg space. I love bricks. I think I''d have titled it "window pie"... but that''s just me.', '2007-06-26 02:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834915, 539294, 66398, '<td valign="top">Pink at night sailors delight. My comment for you though as for a few others in this challenge is that your title indicates the sunset as your subject and the challenge is for negative space to add the wow factor to your subject. If your subject were say a small boat in the foreground (without the bushes) then your bg/negative space would be the sunset and then it works but as your title indicates the sunset IS your subject therefore where''s the neg space? I still think you have a nice shot here so it gets a 5.</td>', 'Pink at night sailors delight. My comment for you though as for a few others in this challenge is that your title indicates the sunset as your subject and the challenge is for negative space to add the wow factor to your subject. If your subject were say a small boat in the foreground (without the bushes) then your bg/negative space would be the sunset and then it works but as your title indicates the sunset IS your subject therefore where''s the neg space? I still think you have a nice shot here so it gets a 5.', '2007-06-26 02:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834919, 539990, 66398, '<td valign="top">Why the ? I like the negative space here. The noise in the sky tells me its a little overprocessed though.</td>', 'Why the ? I like the negative space here. The noise in the sky tells me its a little overprocessed though.', '2007-06-26 03:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834920, 537294, 66398, '<td valign="top">Love the colors.</td>', 'Love the colors.', '2007-06-26 03:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834922, 536354, 66398, '<td valign="top">I don''t see how neg space is here much less adding wow to the shot. I''m sorry to be so blunt. As for technicals I think the windows in the back are damaging the potential of this shot. The effect of the window on the scene is okay but maybe if you were able to get above the scene a little more then you could get less of the window in the shot and crop out what is there. Or maybe an angle from the other side of the room so they''re not in the shot at all? 4</td>', 'I don''t see how neg space is here much less adding wow to the shot. I''m sorry to be so blunt. As for technicals I think the windows in the back are damaging the potential of this shot. The effect of the window on the scene is okay but maybe if you were able to get above the scene a little more then you could get less of the window in the shot and crop out what is there. Or maybe an angle from the other side of the room so they''re not in the shot at all? 4', '2007-06-26 03:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834925, 537154, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nice flower but the bg/neg space doesn''t add to it imo. The white is a little too bright for me.</td>', 'Nice flower but the bg/neg space doesn''t add to it imo. The white is a little too bright for me.', '2007-06-26 03:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834930, 539578, 66398, '<td valign="top">This could be helped imo by recomposing a little to the right and zooming out just a bit to get more sky. Maybe a little bump up in contrast as well.</td>', 'This could be helped imo by recomposing a little to the right and zooming out just a bit to get more sky. Maybe a little bump up in contrast as well.', '2007-06-26 03:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834934, 539492, 66398, '<td valign="top">Maybe a bump in contrast or midtones would make this stand out a little better.</td>', 'Maybe a bump in contrast or midtones would make this stand out a little better.', '2007-06-26 03:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834938, 539202, 66398, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like the treatment here. Some of the lights are blown out too. the shot could be much clearer, did you use a tripod? If you did you may want to try using the timer button so the push of the shutter doesn''t move the camera. The overprocessing made the sky too noisy as well. It was a nice idea and good attempt so just go out and try it again. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Not sure I like the treatment here. Some of the lights are blown out too. the shot could be much clearer, did you use a tripod? If you did you may want to try using the timer button so the push of the shutter doesn''t move the camera. The overprocessing made the sky too noisy as well. It was a nice idea and good attempt so just go out and try it again. Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-06-26 03:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834939, 539869, 66398, '<td valign="top">The color of the sky is nice. It may be obvious to some but who is he?</td>', 'The color of the sky is nice. It may be obvious to some but who is he?', '2007-06-26 03:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834942, 539766, 66398, '<td valign="top">I love the effect of the bg. Nice capture.</td>', 'I love the effect of the bg. Nice capture.', '2007-06-26 03:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834944, 539924, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.</td>', 'Nice colors.', '2007-06-26 03:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834946, 536887, 66398, '<td valign="top">That does look like fun.</td>', 'That does look like fun.', '2007-06-26 03:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834955, 537527, 66398, '<td valign="top">Looks like a window where windows once were. If there is more of the orangish brick on either side of this shot then I think I crop out the blue sky at the top and put more of the brick on the left, right and bottom. Your neg space is really the bricks and the sky adds nothing to the shot. That power line is distracting a little but not too badly imo.</td>', 'Looks like a window where windows once were. If there is more of the orangish brick on either side of this shot then I think I crop out the blue sky at the top and put more of the brick on the left, right and bottom. Your neg space is really the bricks and the sky adds nothing to the shot. That power line is distracting a little but not too badly imo.', '2007-06-26 03:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834967, 540018, 66398, '<td valign="top">If the sunset an flowers are your subject as indicated by the title then what part of this is negative space? Maybe a title of "Horizon" would help guide us to the flowers as the subject of this shot and the neg space is the sunset behind them. Next nice sunset try getting closer to the flowers and give the some light with a flashlight or something and but set your shot up with the same/similiar settings you used here. I think you''d like the effect. And if you use a tripod you''ll get a clearer image as well. 5</td>', 'If the sunset an flowers are your subject as indicated by the title then what part of this is negative space? Maybe a title of "Horizon" would help guide us to the flowers as the subject of this shot and the neg space is the sunset behind them. Next nice sunset try getting closer to the flowers and give the some light with a flashlight or something and but set your shot up with the same/similiar settings you used here. I think you''d like the effect. And if you use a tripod you''ll get a clearer image as well. 5', '2007-06-26 03:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834968, 539300, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nice boat. good neg space but a little more to the top and right would have been better.</td>', 'Nice boat. good neg space but a little more to the top and right would have been better.', '2007-06-26 03:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834976, 539851, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.', '2007-06-26 03:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834983, 539323, 66398, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Wouldn''t have thought of it as a good shot without seeing it. Nice job. Not understanding the title though. Does it have something to do with how the light comes on?</td>', 'Interesting. Wouldn''t have thought of it as a good shot without seeing it. Nice job. Not understanding the title though. Does it have something to do with how the light comes on?', '2007-06-26 03:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3834985, 536145, 66398, '<td valign="top">There''s a spot on his arm. Nice lighting.</td>', 'There''s a spot on his arm. Nice lighting.', '2007-06-26 03:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835003, 537234, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nice skin tones. I don''t like the blue line in the neg space personally though. It seems to cut right through her. Great lighting</td>', 'Nice skin tones. I don''t like the blue line in the neg space personally though. It seems to cut right through her. Great lighting', '2007-06-26 03:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835007, 536701, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting. Good neg space.</td>', 'Nice lighting. Good neg space.', '2007-06-26 03:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835055, 536006, 66398, '<td valign="top">Good neg space. Just a little too much noise in the sky imo. Nice clarity on the lighthouse and bldgs on the island.</td>', 'Good neg space. Just a little too much noise in the sky imo. Nice clarity on the lighthouse and bldgs on the island.', '2007-06-26 04:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
