(3835401, 538992, 57060, '<td valign="top">nice lighting, bold colors.looks a bit soft but still very nice<br/>7<br/>Jack</td>', 'nice lighting, bold colors.looks a bit soft but still very nice7Jack', '2007-06-26 07:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835402, 539411, 57060, '<td valign="top">sky is beautiful with dramatic clouds, colors, contrasts, etc - just doesn''t seem negative to me though<br/>5<br/>Jack</td>', 'sky is beautiful with dramatic clouds, colors, contrasts, etc - just doesn''t seem negative to me though5Jack', '2007-06-26 07:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835405, 539389, 69121, '<td valign="top">I think this would be much better if rotated 90 degrees.</td>', 'I think this would be much better if rotated 90 degrees.', '2007-06-26 07:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835408, 539794, 69121, '<td valign="top">I really like your composition but I think the depth-of-field is just a bit too shallow.</td>', 'I really like your composition but I think the depth-of-field is just a bit too shallow.', '2007-06-26 07:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835410, 536231, 23458, '<td valign="top">Well I think the silhouettes would be stronger if the stage wasn''t so cluttered, but this remains a very nice image. Well done.</td>', 'Well I think the silhouettes would be stronger if the stage wasn''t so cluttered, but this remains a very nice image. Well done.', '2007-06-26 07:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835411, 538853, 23458, '<td valign="top">I''m a little unsure as to why you flipped it rather than shooting the right way the first time. I like the lighting and the grimy feel here though the girl''s pose appears somewhat forced. 7.</td>', 'I''m a little unsure as to why you flipped it rather than shooting the right way the first time. I like the lighting and the grimy feel here though the girl''s pose appears somewhat forced. 7.', '2007-06-26 07:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835413, 538962, 23458, '<td valign="top">The border is perhaps a little heavy handed and the blown out sun a little distracting but, upon further inspection the composition is very pleasing. Very good work.</td>', 'The border is perhaps a little heavy handed and the blown out sun a little distracting but, upon further inspection the composition is very pleasing. Very good work.', '2007-06-26 07:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835414, 540060, 23458, '<td valign="top">Great colours. Tack sharp. Simple yet effective.</td>', 'Great colours. Tack sharp. Simple yet effective.', '2007-06-26 07:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835415, 536419, 23458, '<td valign="top">Like the panning effect here - it works well with your composition.</td>', 'Like the panning effect here - it works well with your composition.', '2007-06-26 07:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835416, 538358, 23458, '<td valign="top">Interesting light on the bird. The background is a bit of a distraction and, to be frank, this probably would have been better as a closer crop. Still, its a solid image. 6.</td>', 'Interesting light on the bird. The background is a bit of a distraction and, to be frank, this probably would have been better as a closer crop. Still, its a solid image. 6.', '2007-06-26 07:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835417, 539378, 23458, '<td valign="top">Nice sky and colour treatment. Would love the boat to stand out slightly more but perhaps you''ve been stifled by the basic editing rules. Creates a sense of drama nonetheless.</td>', 'Nice sky and colour treatment. Would love the boat to stand out slightly more but perhaps you''ve been stifled by the basic editing rules. Creates a sense of drama nonetheless.', '2007-06-26 07:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835419, 539499, 23458, '<td valign="top">Lovely warm feel here. 7</td>', 'Lovely warm feel here. 7', '2007-06-26 08:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835420, 539918, 69121, '<td valign="top">I love this photo but the letter C on the tie ruins it for me.</td>', 'I love this photo but the letter C on the tie ruins it for me.', '2007-06-26 08:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835423, 540186, 23458, '<td valign="top">Is it walking on water? Very cool. Don''t think the negative space adds anything inasmuch as this would work much better if it was simply a closer crop - but it''s a great image anyway. Great sharpness.</td>', 'Is it walking on water? Very cool. Don''t think the negative space adds anything inasmuch as this would work much better if it was simply a closer crop - but it''s a great image anyway. Great sharpness.', '2007-06-26 08:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835424, 540134, 69121, '<td valign="top">Play with Levels and/or Contrast to create a completely black background.</td>', 'Play with Levels and/or Contrast to create a completely black background.', '2007-06-26 08:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835425, 535345, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is, unfortunately one time where keeping it simple hasn''t done you any favours. The lighting here is a bit flat and the thimble could be sharper. I''d try playing around a bit more with curves and contrast - perhaps a touch of USM too. <br/> <br/>All the best with future challenges.</td>', 'This is, unfortunately one time where keeping it simple hasn''t done you any favours. The lighting here is a bit flat and the thimble could be sharper. I''d try playing around a bit more with curves and contrast - perhaps a touch of USM too.  All the best with future challenges.', '2007-06-26 08:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835426, 539641, 23458, '<td valign="top">The barbed wire here isn''t as sharp as I''d like - other than that its a nice composition and the colours are certainly pretty.</td>', 'The barbed wire here isn''t as sharp as I''d like - other than that its a nice composition and the colours are certainly pretty.', '2007-06-26 08:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835427, 537956, 23458, '<td valign="top">The yellow tone here is perhaps somewhat offputting. But the exposure is spot on. The tie adds another dimension. Great work.</td>', 'The yellow tone here is perhaps somewhat offputting. But the exposure is spot on. The tie adds another dimension. Great work.', '2007-06-26 08:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835429, 539142, 23458, '<td valign="top">Amazing sky. It''s probably not my favourite here, but I think you may have won this challenge. 8.</td>', 'Amazing sky. It''s probably not my favourite here, but I think you may have won this challenge. 8.', '2007-06-26 08:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835431, 536891, 23458, '<td valign="top">Genuinely lovely. Great DOF. Subtle excellence. 8.</td>', 'Genuinely lovely. Great DOF. Subtle excellence. 8.', '2007-06-26 08:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835433, 539446, 23458, '<td valign="top">There appears to be something of a weird blotchy artefact across the sky - but a cool landscape and great composition all the same.</td>', 'There appears to be something of a weird blotchy artefact across the sky - but a cool landscape and great composition all the same.', '2007-06-26 08:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835435, 539430, 23458, '<td valign="top">I like this. I''d probably like it better if you hadn''t included the trees etc - but simply cropping them off would throw the composition out of wack. 7.</td>', 'I like this. I''d probably like it better if you hadn''t included the trees etc - but simply cropping them off would throw the composition out of wack. 7.', '2007-06-26 08:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835438, 535675, 69121, '<td valign="top">Because the entire image is brown it is hard to see the subject; thus there is no <b>obvious</b> negative space.</td>', 'Because the entire image is brown it is hard to see the subject; thus there is no obvious negative space.', '2007-06-26 08:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835440, 539234, 23458, '<td valign="top">Awesome. Really awesome. Drama filled. My new favourite (and first 10) in this challenge.</td>', 'Awesome. Really awesome. Drama filled. My new favourite (and first 10) in this challenge.', '2007-06-26 08:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835446, 540062, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is very much like a shot elsapo submitted in a challenge a couple of months ago - so much so that I''d be very surprised if it wasn''t. To be honest this just isn''t as strong as that shot - the comp is still nice but the background doesn''t carry the same level of impact. Still, a 7 from me.</td>', 'This is very much like a shot elsapo submitted in a challenge a couple of months ago - so much so that I''d be very surprised if it wasn''t. To be honest this just isn''t as strong as that shot - the comp is still nice but the background doesn''t carry the same level of impact. Still, a 7 from me.', '2007-06-26 08:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835584, 540178, 80453, '<td valign="top">LOVE THE CLOUD FORMATION, HAS LOTS OF POWER</td>', 'LOVE THE CLOUD FORMATION, HAS LOTS OF POWER', '2007-06-26 09:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3835611, 540057, 75898, '<td valign="top">I think this would be better suited to the challenge if the angle only showed a few people.  As it is, the space isn''t ''negative'' enough IMO.</td>', 'I think this would be better suited to the challenge if the angle only showed a few people.  As it is, the space isn''t ''negative'' enough IMO.', '2007-06-26 09:28:09.000000', NULL, 1);
