(3835781, 538833, 24454, '<td valign="top">I really love photos like this.   If I lived near a body of water, a photo like this would have been my first choice for negative space.  Very well done!</td>', 'I really love photos like this.   If I lived near a body of water, a photo like this would have been my first choice for negative space.  Very well done!', '2007-06-26 10:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
