(3837628, 538454, 78114, '<td valign="top">i love the way his whole right side just disappears... as if he no longer needs it with the loss of the eye. great emotion captured here. nice texture.</td>', 'i love the way his whole right side just disappears... as if he no longer needs it with the loss of the eye. great emotion captured here. nice texture.', '2007-06-26 18:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837629, 539361, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lovely, exotic dragonfly, and some good use of the space, although I don''t feel a particular purpose to it, but simply just some openness that helps focus on the subject.</td>', 'Lovely, exotic dragonfly, and some good use of the space, although I don''t feel a particular purpose to it, but simply just some openness that helps focus on the subject.', '2007-06-26 18:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837634, 539764, 78114, '<td valign="top">what a cutie! great capture of a speedy little creature!</td>', 'what a cutie! great capture of a speedy little creature!', '2007-06-26 18:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837661, 539446, 8860, '<td valign="top">... apart from a photographer that is.<br/> <br/>Great expanse of land and superb light. <br/> <br/>I''m not being deliberately annoying here, but I just don''t know what I''m supposed to feel about this photo. It''s not emotive for me, so I''m left being quite conscious of your presence in the scene. I don''t know what it needs but perhaps the girl should be naked or in tattered clothes, perhaps with a more muted or even cross-processed tonal treatment. The current vibrance belies your title and the colour denotes more of a fashion shoot to me than a poignant, lonely one.</td>', '... apart from a photographer that is. Great expanse of land and superb light.  I''m not being deliberately annoying here, but I just don''t know what I''m supposed to feel about this photo. It''s not emotive for me, so I''m left being quite conscious of your presence in the scene. I don''t know what it needs but perhaps the girl should be naked or in tattered clothes, perhaps with a more muted or even cross-processed tonal treatment. The current vibrance belies your title and the colour denotes more of a fashion shoot to me than a poignant, lonely one.', '2007-06-26 18:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837663, 539553, 78114, '<td valign="top">nice job! you must tell me the inspiration for this... i feel i have seen this image from an oil painter and i can''t quite place it! beautiful capture of the light, color, her innocence.</td>', 'nice job! you must tell me the inspiration for this... i feel i have seen this image from an oil painter and i can''t quite place it! beautiful capture of the light, color, her innocence.', '2007-06-26 18:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837671, 539930, 8860, '<td valign="top">Good use of bokeh for your space, although the shot does little for me otherwise.</td>', 'Good use of bokeh for your space, although the shot does little for me otherwise.', '2007-06-26 18:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
