(3837680, 536641, 78114, '<td valign="top">cool. the desat really adds to the mystery of the shot. gives it a real turn of the century (19 to 20th) feel to it.</td>', 'cool. the desat really adds to the mystery of the shot. gives it a real turn of the century (19 to 20th) feel to it.', '2007-06-26 18:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
