(3837721, 539792, 73661, '<td valign="top">I love negative spaces and even though this is a flower shot, in which I am not super fond of, I find this really great. The use of 3 of the basic colors i.e. greens, purples combined with the yellow is simple yet very effective. You get a 9 from me. ^_^</td>', 'I love negative spaces and even though this is a flower shot, in which I am not super fond of, I find this really great. The use of 3 of the basic colors i.e. greens, purples combined with the yellow is simple yet very effective. You get a 9 from me. ^_^', '2007-06-26 18:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3837722, 539894, 93927, '<td valign="top">wow, this is a cool shot! carrots look very in focus, don''t know if the lack of separation in on the top and bottom were done on purpose (i''ll just say it is so i can give you a higher score!) but i love this image, congrats!</td>', 'wow, this is a cool shot! carrots look very in focus, don''t know if the lack of separation in on the top and bottom were done on purpose (i''ll just say it is so i can give you a higher score!) but i love this image, congrats!', '2007-06-26 18:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
