(3838002, 538044, 8860, '<td valign="top">What a cute little thing, and the space works well here. There is s strong sense of isolation and challenge of life, against which this caterpillar''s spikes seem to be its only defence.</td>', 'What a cute little thing, and the space works well here. There is s strong sense of isolation and challenge of life, against which this caterpillar''s spikes seem to be its only defence.', '2007-06-26 20:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
