(3838704, 539238, 66398, '<td valign="top">Now this one is a different take on the challenge that works. Most (me included don''t have much content in the bg but this one works to show the subjects height the spectators below give it the wow. Good concentration on his face. The right hand position isn''t good though because its right in the middle of that ladder. I would crop a tiny bit off the top to get rid of the persons legs though. great capture. 8</td>', 'Now this one is a different take on the challenge that works. Most (me included don''t have much content in the bg but this one works to show the subjects height the spectators below give it the wow. Good concentration on his face. The right hand position isn''t good though because its right in the middle of that ladder. I would crop a tiny bit off the top to get rid of the persons legs though. great capture. 8', '2007-06-26 23:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838706, 539395, 66398, '<td valign="top">Now that neg space adds wow to the subject.</td>', 'Now that neg space adds wow to the subject.', '2007-06-26 23:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838708, 539252, 66398, '<td valign="top">Wow. This is very good and I see it on the front page? ribbon? I like the clarity on the dragonfly and the colors.</td>', 'Wow. This is very good and I see it on the front page? ribbon? I like the clarity on the dragonfly and the colors.', '2007-06-26 23:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
