(3838724, 539213, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nice. Would''ve been better imo if the same shot were just a plant of some kind beginning growth from the cracks. Color, clarity, content, and compositions are all very good.</td>', 'Nice. Would''ve been better imo if the same shot were just a plant of some kind beginning growth from the cracks. Color, clarity, content, and compositions are all very good.', '2007-06-26 23:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838730, 539956, 66398, '<td valign="top">Oops looks like I missed one comment... you get the last one. I guess I missed it cause I voted on it first. Picked it out as the top shot in the challenge on day 1. Going back through to bump where needed.</td>', 'Oops looks like I missed one comment... you get the last one. I guess I missed it cause I voted on it first. Picked it out as the top shot in the challenge on day 1. Going back through to bump where needed.', '2007-06-26 23:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
