(3838735, 540104, 66398, '<td valign="top">Very nice. This works well. The title helps and even though the bg is a blank palet it works for this with the flowers color.</td>', 'Very nice. This works well. The title helps and even though the bg is a blank palet it works for this with the flowers color.', '2007-06-26 23:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838736, 536674, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nice. I like the meaning added to this shot. The gap in the negative space (the window) really adds to the effect too.</td>', 'Nice. I like the meaning added to this shot. The gap in the negative space (the window) really adds to the effect too.', '2007-06-26 23:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838738, 539803, 66398, '<td valign="top">She doesn''t look like she''s fading to me. She''s just right. lol. Nice shot. The dof is perfect keeping the flower and stem all in focus and the bg nicely blurred but not so much that its distracting.</td>', 'She doesn''t look like she''s fading to me. She''s just right. lol. Nice shot. The dof is perfect keeping the flower and stem all in focus and the bg nicely blurred but not so much that its distracting.', '2007-06-26 23:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838746, 536355, 66398, '<td valign="top">Wow. Now that is very cool!! You timed that shot just right to catch him right in the middle. The only thing I can think of that would make this better is the color of the bg. Maybe a blue tint to it? But doing something like that in basic would also change the skin tone which wouldn''t look good I suppose. Nice shot. bump</td>', 'Wow. Now that is very cool!! You timed that shot just right to catch him right in the middle. The only thing I can think of that would make this better is the color of the bg. Maybe a blue tint to it? But doing something like that in basic would also change the skin tone which wouldn''t look good I suppose. Nice shot. bump', '2007-06-26 23:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838747, 539761, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2007-06-26 23:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838751, 539745, 66398, '<td valign="top">Just a wet dandelion right? But it''s so pretty!!</td>', 'Just a wet dandelion right? But it''s so pretty!!', '2007-06-26 23:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838752, 539337, 66398, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge very well and nice shot altogether.</td>', 'Fits the challenge very well and nice shot altogether.', '2007-06-26 23:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838755, 540060, 66398, '<td valign="top">This works well for the challenge imo. It would have been nice to get just one of the seed pods floating up to the right. Good technicals.</td>', 'This works well for the challenge imo. It would have been nice to get just one of the seed pods floating up to the right. Good technicals.', '2007-06-26 23:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
