(3838759, 538774, 66398, '<td valign="top">That''s a different take on the neg space. Gives it more interest. The only thing I can think of that might improve it for me is if instead of making it b/w, you desated everything except green (unless the bg had green in it).</td>', 'That''s a different take on the neg space. Gives it more interest. The only thing I can think of that might improve it for me is if instead of making it b/w, you desated everything except green (unless the bg had green in it).', '2007-06-26 23:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838760, 539947, 66398, '<td valign="top">Great technicals. There is neg space but, it doesn''t add (nor detract) to the image for me.</td>', 'Great technicals. There is neg space but, it doesn''t add (nor detract) to the image for me.', '2007-06-26 23:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838761, 539858, 66398, '<td valign="top">Now that bg compliments the subject. Good lighting comp, clarity, color. Nice entry.</td>', 'Now that bg compliments the subject. Good lighting comp, clarity, color. Nice entry.', '2007-06-26 23:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838765, 538870, 66398, '<td valign="top">Another nice silhouette. Very good color on the sky too. Really makes him pop out there which is the purpose of the challenge.</td>', 'Another nice silhouette. Very good color on the sky too. Really makes him pop out there which is the purpose of the challenge.', '2007-06-26 23:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838766, 539446, 66398, '<td valign="top">And a nice long shadow. This is a great example of neg space imo. The size difference is what makes this shot work so well.</td>', 'And a nice long shadow. This is a great example of neg space imo. The size difference is what makes this shot work so well.', '2007-06-26 23:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838768, 539189, 66398, '<td valign="top">Color, clarity, content, and comp all work to make this a great shot. Neg space gives the title meaning (or vice versa). It works very well for the challenge imo.</td>', 'Color, clarity, content, and comp all work to make this a great shot. Neg space gives the title meaning (or vice versa). It works very well for the challenge imo.', '2007-06-26 23:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838773, 540108, 66398, '<td valign="top">Oh that''s beautiful!!</td>', 'Oh that''s beautiful!!', '2007-06-26 23:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838779, 536223, 66398, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I love the clarity here and the colors are vibrant yet not overwhelming. Lighting is perfect. Composition is great. Great shot overall. Bump</td>', 'Beautiful. I love the clarity here and the colors are vibrant yet not overwhelming. Lighting is perfect. Composition is great. Great shot overall. Bump', '2007-06-26 23:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838780, 537180, 66398, '<td valign="top">Oh that''s nice. The light hits the boat just right in this. Nice clear image with neg space that helps to see the isolation inferred in the title.</td>', 'Oh that''s nice. The light hits the boat just right in this. Nice clear image with neg space that helps to see the isolation inferred in the title.', '2007-06-26 23:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838783, 539553, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity and color. She even looks like she''s looking for it. I think a little more of the bg would help but overall very nice shot.</td>', 'Nice clarity and color. She even looks like she''s looking for it. I think a little more of the bg would help but overall very nice shot.', '2007-06-26 23:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838784, 537993, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Great comp, color, lighting, content and clarity. Great capture with nice neg space.</td>', 'Nicely done. Great comp, color, lighting, content and clarity. Great capture with nice neg space.', '2007-06-26 23:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
