(3838791, 539167, 66398, '<td valign="top">Is this the last shot from the camera in <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=625955" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">THIS</a> thread? lol. this is a great example of how the title helps draw your attention to the subject (the engine) and leaving the rest of the shot as the neg space which creates the wow of the subject. I like the angle you chose to keep.</td>', 'Is this the last shot from the camera in THIS thread? lol. this is a great example of how the title helps draw your attention to the subject (the engine) and leaving the rest of the shot as the neg space which creates the wow of the subject. I like the angle you chose to keep.', '2007-06-26 23:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
