(3838813, 538222, 66398, '<td valign="top">Not fond of the lighting angle on the girl. maybe if a soft diffused light were added to her right side? I like the shadows on her body, dress and shoulder but the shadow on her left eye is what bothers me I think. You got the light bulb very nicely though and nothing seems too blown out to me. The clarity is good too.</td>', 'Not fond of the lighting angle on the girl. maybe if a soft diffused light were added to her right side? I like the shadows on her body, dress and shoulder but the shadow on her left eye is what bothers me I think. You got the light bulb very nicely though and nothing seems too blown out to me. The clarity is good too.', '2007-06-26 23:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838814, 537706, 66398, '<td valign="top">The title makes this work very well for the challenge.</td>', 'The title makes this work very well for the challenge.', '2007-06-26 23:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
