(3838819, 540136, 66398, '<td valign="top">Wow now the 5th dragonfly in this challenge so far. Very nice shot and pretty dragonfly but the neg space is too bland and doesn''t really add to the wow imo.</td>', 'Wow now the 5th dragonfly in this challenge so far. Very nice shot and pretty dragonfly but the neg space is too bland and doesn''t really add to the wow imo.', '2007-06-26 23:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838824, 539342, 66398, '<td valign="top">Your subject fills the frame leaving almost no negative space. Perhaps you were going for that type of image that one person sees the old lady and another sees the young lady? I do see the 3 faces looking toward the left and the 1 looking to the right. The way the furthest left face and the one face looking right cross over eachother adds to personality of this shot.</td>', 'Your subject fills the frame leaving almost no negative space. Perhaps you were going for that type of image that one person sees the old lady and another sees the young lady? I do see the 3 faces looking toward the left and the 1 looking to the right. The way the furthest left face and the one face looking right cross over eachother adds to personality of this shot.', '2007-06-26 23:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3838826, 535851, 66398, '<td valign="top">Yes it is and all that neg space just proves it. nice shot.</td>', 'Yes it is and all that neg space just proves it. nice shot.', '2007-06-26 23:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
