(3839975, 539142, 63812, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo. But I want to understand how  your moon seems a Full Moon, if in June 18, the moon were in increasing phase, visible only an 14%.(The  aspect of the lunar phase of that night is seen in this: <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=539833" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=539833</a> or in this <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=538958)" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=538958)</a> <br/> Anyway, amazing, magic shot! Congratulations!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-06-27 01:48:28.</i></td>', 'I really like this photo. But I want to understand how  your moon seems a Full Moon, if in June 18, the moon were in increasing phase, visible only an 14%.(The  aspect of the lunar phase of that night is seen in this: //www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=539833 or in this //www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=538958)  Anyway, amazing, magic shot! Congratulations!', '2007-06-27 02:22:44.000000', '2007-06-27 02:48:28.000000', 0),
