(3840696, 539142, 30982, '<td valign="top">Without the stance and presence of the photographer, it would be just another really nice night shot with awesome stars, planets and moon.  WITH the photographer, it takes on a whole different and far more intriguing storyline - one that I''m sure a lot of us here can relate to.  Excellent work and congratulations on the blue!</td>', 'Without the stance and presence of the photographer, it would be just another really nice night shot with awesome stars, planets and moon.  WITH the photographer, it takes on a whole different and far more intriguing storyline - one that I''m sure a lot of us here can relate to.  Excellent work and congratulations on the blue!', '2007-06-27 08:36:43.000000', NULL, 0),
