(3840721, 539234, 19474, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Skip:</b></div><hr/><i> nice work, as always!  i can''t help but feel, though, that if you hadn''t centered your subject, you probably would have ribboned ;-) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I thought the challenge was about negative space where the back ground is the important part of the photo so I wanted the maximum size back ground so I didn''t crop at all... more fool me</td>', 'Originally posted by Skip: nice work, as always!  i can''t help but feel, though, that if you hadn''t centered your subject, you probably would have ribboned ;-)  I thought the challenge was about negative space where the back ground is the important part of the photo so I wanted the maximum size back ground so I didn''t crop at all... more fool me', '2007-06-27 08:49:52.000000', NULL, 0),
