(3840831, 537245, 67697, '<td valign="top">I liked this but ran out of time to comment.  I thought the use of black neg space is a great compliment to the subject.  The lighting is great and I like that you can see both of his eyes.  I think your title lead me to believe he was either about to give a speech or was headed to a service.  As usual - great photo!</td>', 'I liked this but ran out of time to comment.  I thought the use of black neg space is a great compliment to the subject.  The lighting is great and I like that you can see both of his eyes.  I think your title lead me to believe he was either about to give a speech or was headed to a service.  As usual - great photo!', '2007-06-27 09:31:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3840851, 539578, 78718, '<td valign="top">Thank you for the comments. This crop was not my favorite of this shot.  My internet was down so I went to the local library to post and discovered the other files just over the 150kb limit. I had another crop that I straightend the tower as it did seem to be leaning a little. Oh well, I am in this to improve my shots, thanks again for the comments.</td>', 'Thank you for the comments. This crop was not my favorite of this shot.  My internet was down so I went to the local library to post and discovered the other files just over the 150kb limit. I had another crop that I straightend the tower as it did seem to be leaning a little. Oh well, I am in this to improve my shots, thanks again for the comments.', '2007-06-27 09:38:22.000000', NULL, 0),
