(3841816, 539552, 66398, '<td valign="top">AAHHHHH. Thanks for the PM. Now I see it. I''m sorry I didn''t see it before. That''s pretty cool though. I wonder how it would''ve done if you had titled it something that made people look for that. I still don''t get the title you did give it but, probably my narrow minded thinking again. Maybe a title like what you sent in the PM. "Look for her body". Sometimes we get on a track of thinking and it takes prompting to see anything else. You deserved better just for the different take and if I had seen it earlier then I would''ve given a higher score.<br/>Sheryll</td>', 'AAHHHHH. Thanks for the PM. Now I see it. I''m sorry I didn''t see it before. That''s pretty cool though. I wonder how it would''ve done if you had titled it something that made people look for that. I still don''t get the title you did give it but, probably my narrow minded thinking again. Maybe a title like what you sent in the PM. "Look for her body". Sometimes we get on a track of thinking and it takes prompting to see anything else. You deserved better just for the different take and if I had seen it earlier then I would''ve given a higher score.Sheryll', '2007-06-27 13:31:58.000000', NULL, 0),
