(3843268, 536231, 22734, '<td valign="top">When you have one person control is more at our disposal, but with three it simply multiplies the possibilities and variations. Hard to make this capture and have it speak so well! Congratulations on your yellow.</td>', 'When you have one person control is more at our disposal, but with three it simply multiplies the possibilities and variations. Hard to make this capture and have it speak so well! Congratulations on your yellow.', '2007-06-27 20:49:27.000000', NULL, 0),
