(3843279, 538962, 22734, '<td valign="top">The red adds that great ballast feel against the shadow area and then the wonderful vastness. Very well conceived! Congratulations on your 5th place.</td>', 'The red adds that great ballast feel against the shadow area and then the wonderful vastness. Very well conceived! Congratulations on your 5th place.', '2007-06-27 20:52:28.000000', NULL, 0),
