(3844322, 539142, 49865, '<td valign="top">I would have to agree that the blue presentation makes this one go down smooth and sweet. Elements of the composition disagree with my slightly, but as you said, rattlesnakes are a serious deterrant from tromping around at night too much, and I don''t mean to say the result is anything less than great. I know it can be a challenge to make stars really stand out without greatly exaggerating the noise in the photo, but you''ve managed to avoid that here and the image is quite enjoyable to look at.</td>', 'I would have to agree that the blue presentation makes this one go down smooth and sweet. Elements of the composition disagree with my slightly, but as you said, rattlesnakes are a serious deterrant from tromping around at night too much, and I don''t mean to say the result is anything less than great. I know it can be a challenge to make stars really stand out without greatly exaggerating the noise in the photo, but you''ve managed to avoid that here and the image is quite enjoyable to look at.', '2007-06-28 02:08:24.000000', NULL, 0),
