(3844857, 540161, 67697, '<td valign="top">I agree with <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=50695" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">posthumous</a>, maybe a little closer crop.  Nice job using the lighting to catch the beautiful colors of the feather!</td>', 'I agree with  posthumous, maybe a little closer crop.  Nice job using the lighting to catch the beautiful colors of the feather!', '2007-06-28 10:13:34.000000', NULL, 0),
