(4076116, 535666, 51269, '<td valign="top">I recently had to put my feline friend , Max , to "sleep". Your image reminds me of him...<br/>If it should be that I grow weak<br/>and pain should keep me from my sleep,<br/>Then you must do what must be done,<br/>for this last battle cannot be won.<br/> <br/>You will be sad, I understand,<br/>Don''t let your grief then stay your hand.<br/>For this day more than all the rest, <br/>your love for me must stay the test.<br/> <br/>We''ve had so many happy years,<br/>what is to come can hold no fears.<br/>You''d not want me to suffer so.<br/>The time has come,please let me go.<br/>                                           Author Unknown<br/></td>', 'I recently had to put my feline friend , Max , to "sleep". Your image reminds me of him...If it should be that I grow weakand pain should keep me from my sleep,Then you must do what must be done,for this last battle cannot be won. You will be sad, I understand,Don''t let your grief then stay your hand.For this day more than all the rest, your love for me must stay the test. We''ve had so many happy years,what is to come can hold no fears.You''d not want me to suffer so.The time has come,please let me go.                                           Author Unknown', '2007-09-09 23:37:25.000000', NULL, 0),
